    my "我们尽力了，但没时间把它做完。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1155
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_91b1122d_1:

    # "*{i}Phone rings{/i}*"
    "*{i}电话铃声响起{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1156
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_7be3c0ef_1:

    # mc "(Not now, Quinn...)"
    mc "(现在不是时候，Quinn...)"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1158
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_b0149173:

    # js "What do we do now? We gotta be able to do something, right?"
    js "现在怎么办？我们总得做点什么吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1160
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_15379094:

    # sa "If we can't get the contract this way, we must confront him about it and force him to show it."
    sa "如果我们这样搞不到合同，那就得直接找他理论，逼他拿出来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1162
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_4a90cb72:

    # ji "There's probably some way we can go about it, but none that comes to mind now."
    ji "应该还有办法，只是现在想不到。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1164
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_928f2781:

    # my "It's ok, guys."
    my "这事儿我们能处理。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1166
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_9f513764:

    # js "How can you say it's ok? It's not ok!"
    js "你怎么能说没关系？这根本就不是没关系的事！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1168
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_ab11db54:

    # my "I've thought about this for a long time."
    my "我早就想过了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1169
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_6c8b2fb5:

    # my "We've wracked our heads trying to solve it, only to come up short every time we get an idea."
    my "我们已经绞尽脑汁想办法解决它，每次想到个主意，结果都行不通。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1171
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_0276c1c6:

    # my "But the more I think about ways to solve it, the less it matters if we do."
    my "但越想解决办法，就越觉得结果其实并不重要了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1172
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_a2a799c1:

    # my "Because with all of you here trying to help me, I feel like I've already won."
    my "因为有你们都在这里帮我，我感觉我已经赢了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1174
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_951b06e7:

    # js "But you haven't won, Maya. Your dad still controls you."
    js "但你还没赢，Maya。你爸还在控制你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1176
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_d999995a:

    # my "Yeah, you're right. He does."
    my "你说得对，他确实这样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1177
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_ea3655ec:

    # my "But I look at it like this... In a few more years from now, it won't matter."
    my "但我看这事儿是这么个理儿……再过几年，这一切就都不重要了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1178
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_fc019e30:

    # my "The day I graduate from college, it stops mattering. There is an end to this; it's just not today."
    my "我大学一毕业，这一切就都不再重要了。总会有个结束的那天，只是不是今天。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1180
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_407103e4:

    # js "That's the whole point of this! We want it to end today! Not in years from now."
    js "这就是我们想要的！我们希望它今天就结束！而不是几年之后！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1181
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_98d00b55:

    # js "Do you plan on living like this during that time? Because I don't think I can do that."
    js "你打算在那段时间一直这样过下去吗？我觉得我做不到。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1183
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_7ee530c8:

    # my "Don't get me wrong. It sucks!"
    my "别误会，这真烦人！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1184
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_6e6485b6:

    # my "But I've finally reached a point where I get to study something I'm passionate about."
    my "但我想我终于到了可以学习自己真正热爱的东西的时候了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1186
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_a8058342:

    # my "I love college so much..."
    my "我超级爱大学生活……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1187
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_84149c30:

    # my "And I don't want to let go of that."
    my "我不想放手。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1189
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_96936153:

    # my "We will be in college for what seems like a long time, but look at how fast we reached the end of our first semester. It's almost here..."
    my "我们在大学里的时间似乎很长，但看看我们第一个学期就结束了，快到了……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1190
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_8ae3d477:

    # my "I want to focus on what I came here to do and not waste energy fighting this."
    my "我想专注在来这里要做的事情上，别浪费力气在这场争斗里。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1192
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_3ca98a4f:

    # js "And what about everything we've done so far? How we've brought everyone together to help you..."
    js "那我们到目前为止做的一切呢？我们是怎么把大家聚在一起帮你渡过难关的……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1193
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_f72622e2:

    # js "Doesn't that matter anymore?"
    js "这不重要了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1195
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_5a8aaee5:

    # my "Of course, you guys matter. You're the ones who've made it easier for me."
    my "当然，你们都很重要。是你们让这一切变得更容易了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1196
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_b29e7867:

    # my "Before, I didn't have anyone else to share this with. I felt so alone, but now you are helping me carry this burden."
    my "以前我没人可以分担这些，感觉特别孤单，但现在你们帮我分担了这份压力。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1198
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_48f7aab9:

    # my "And opening up about it has done a lot for me, more than I thought it would."
    my "坦白这件事对我帮助很大，比我想象的还要多。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1199
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_99cb952a:

    # my "I don't see this as giving up, Josy. I will remember how everyone did their best."
    my "我这不是放弃，Josy。我会记住大家是怎么尽自己最大努力的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1201
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_9b812ef1:

    # js "This is not what I want, Maya."
    js "这也不是我想要的，Maya。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1203
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_1234e014:

    # my "It's not what I want, either. But it's what I choose."
    my "这也不是我想要的。但这是我选择的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1205
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_69f93d6c:

    # mc "Tonight, I caught Patrick abusing her."
    mc "今晚上我看到Patrick在欺负她。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1207
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_9d799e16_1:

    # ji "Oh my God..."
    ji "天啊..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1209
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_2cc76239_2:

    # js "What? Maya...?"
    js "什么？Maya...？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1216
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_d159fc3b:

    # mc "This is not what you choose, Maya. It's what's left when all options are exhausted."
    mc "这不是你选择的，Maya。这是所有选择都用尽之后剩下的东西。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1217
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_8bf15282:

    # mc "You're forced to choose this."
    mc "你只能被迫做出这个选择。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1219
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_d0327579:

    # my "You might think that, but there is a choice as long as options exist."
    my "你可能这么想，但只要还有选择存在，就永远有选择。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1220
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_075794ab:

    # my "It's just that my options scare me too much. There's too much risk involved in confronting Dad."
    my "只是我那些选择也让我太害怕了。和我爸正面冲突的风险实在太大。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1222
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_28bb024c:

    # my "If I choose to do that and he takes college away from me... If he takes you guys away from me..."
    my "如果我选了这条路，他把我大学给取消了……如果他把我你们也给取消了……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1223
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_e528974d:

    # my "I wouldn't want to live with that choice."
    my "我可不想活在那样的选择里。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1224
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_00eed5e1:

    # my "And that's why I choose this. Because you guys will still be here, and I can go to school every day."
    my "这就是我为什么选择这条路。因为你们还会在这里，我每天还能去上学。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1230
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_9ba218ec:

    # mc "Since the first day I wanted to help you, it's been about letting you make your own choices."
    mc "从我第一天想帮你开始，就一直是在让你自己做决定。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1231
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_7a8f44d5:

    # mc "If this is what you choose and you don't want us to keep trying to find new ways for it to end, I will respect it."
    mc "如果这就是你的选择，而且你不想我们继续想办法让它结束，我会尊重你的决定。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1233
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_a9131a03:

    # js "But [name]..."
    js "但[name]..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1235
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_fe2e2716:

    # mc "The options she gets to choose between aren't what we want them to be, but it's still a choice."
    mc "她能选择的选项不一定是我们要的，但至少她还有选择的权利。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1236
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_36ba7328:

    # mc "If we choose for her, we're no better than Patrick."
    mc "如果我们替她做决定，那我们和Patrick也没什么两样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1238
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_09b1753e:

    # my "Thank you, [name]."
    my "谢谢，[name]."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1241
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_395627df:

    # js "Maya? A word?"
    js "Maya？说句话？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1243
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_f13c82f9:

    # js "What about me? What about us? Where's us in your choice?"
    js "那我呢？我们呢？你在选择里头有没有我们？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1245
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_bf2c2474:

    # my "It's been hard, but you've been here alongside me so far. Haven't you?"
    my "这段日子挺难的，但你一直在我身边，不是吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1247
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_9dcd3bc6_1:

    # js "..."
    js "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1249
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_1d766242:

    # my "I'm not choosing to leave you."
    my "我没选择离开你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1250
translate schinese ep11_tg_label_9dc7f184:

    # my "You're still a part of my choice. But I can't decide if you want to be."
    my "你还是我选择的一部分。但我还不能确定你是否真的想成为其中一员。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1274
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_7968c784:

    # qu "Let me in."
    qu "让我进去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1286
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_f17dcede:

    # qu "Where is she?"
    qu "她在哪？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1288
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_4a72c52b:

    # bd "Take off your jacket."
    bd "脱掉夹克。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1292
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_74c2ae37:

    # bd "I'm gonna assume you brought some kind of a weapon."
    bd "我得假设你带了什么武器。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1293
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_3fa622aa:

    # bd "Raise your arms and let Mick search you."
    bd "举手让Mick搜身。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1300
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_8c143006:

    # bd "Haha!"
    bd "哈哈！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1301
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_95839508:

    # bd "Why would you bring that?"
    bd "你带这个干什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1302
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_ea1d93a5:

    # bd "It's like from those corny movies your dad liked."
    bd "就像你爸喜欢的那种老掉牙的电影。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1303
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_cb3b20d4:

    # bd "You don't bring a knife to a gunfight. He loved that line."
    bd "你带刀去枪战，那可不是明智之举。他最喜欢这句话。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1305
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_6d360866:

    # qu "Don't flatter yourself. I'm not planning to dull that blade on your sad ass. I always carry it."
    qu "别自欺欺人。我可没打算用你的破刀来磨我的刀。我一直都带着它。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1307
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_54e3791e:

    # bd "Remove your shoes, too. I don't need you making the place dirtier."
    bd "也脱掉鞋子。我可不想让你让这儿更脏。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1311
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_d84ffbb0:

    # bd "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    bd "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1312
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_78920ddb:

    # bd "Then again, what's a little mud on the floor when we have to clean up the blood from your friend?"
    bd "反正我们还得清理你朋友留下的血，地板上沾点泥又算什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1316
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_0aa78ab1:

    # bd "Sit the fuck down!"
    bd "坐下！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1318
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_c3ffe4ff:

    # bd "..."
    bd "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1320
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_027a9223:

    # bd "I always had a hunch there were things you weren't telling me..."
    bd "我一直在怀疑你没跟我说实话……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1321
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_98900bbb:

    # bd "I'll give you one chance to tell me the truth. And it better be the truth."
    bd "我给你最后一次机会说真话。而且，这次必须是真话。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1322
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_29c250d4:

    # bd "Because you should know that I've grown tired of your bullshit excuses and vaguery."
    bd "因为你该知道，我已经受够了你的鬼话和含糊其辞。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1324
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_7b230275:

    # qu "Where is Riona?"
    qu "Riona在哪？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1326
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_f1adafab:

    # bd "I'll tell you where she is. Better yet, let's make a deal for it."
    bd "我会告诉你她在哪里。更妙的是，我们来个交易。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1327
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_9f821362:

    # bd "For every piece of truth you tell me, I'll give you a piece of your friend back."
    bd "每告诉你一个真相，我就还你一个朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1329
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_ae435e20:

    # bd "And I'm feeling generous tonight. I'll kick it off."
    bd "我现在心情不错，先来点热身的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1337
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_772841e2:

    # bd "Now it's your turn."
    bd "现在轮到你了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1339
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_ec3df409:

    # qu "..."
    qu "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1341
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_9cea3b83:

    # qu "What did you do to her?"
    qu "你对她做了什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1343
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_6747ece5:

    # bd "No way. Are you crying?"
    bd "不可能。你是在哭吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1345
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_51e5d0f9:

    # bd "You didn't even shed a tear for your dad as he spasmed to death on the floor in front of us, but for this bitch you cry?"
    bd "你连你爸在我们面前抽搐着死掉都没掉一滴眼泪，现在却为这个婊子掉眼泪？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1348
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_09c05f27:

    # bd "THIS BITCH THAT YOU USED TO FUCK ME OVER WITH, YOU CRY FOR!?"
    bd "你他妈还哭个屁！你以前用这婊子害我，现在哭什么哭！？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1350
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_3c7b16a4:

    # bd "I'm not getting a story from you, am I?"
    bd "看来你是不会告诉我了，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1351
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_afb0e85c:

    # bd "You don't have to bother. Wipe that snot off your face."
    bd "你不用费劲了。擦擦你脸上的鼻涕。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1353
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_fa9c5d83:

    # bd "Your bitch ass friend told us everything."
    bd "你那狗屎朋友把什么都告诉了我们。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1354
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_3ec2bc20:

    # bd "She whimpered and squealed like a pig as she ratted you out."
    bd "她像猪一样呜咽尖叫，出卖了你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1358
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_30373954:

    # bd "Bring me the money you owe. Every single dollar you've charged extra belongs to me."
    bd "给我你欠的钱。你每多收的一块钱都归我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1359
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_ab2fa2f7:

    # bd "And every penny you'll make extra from now on also belongs to me."
    bd "而且你以后赚到的每一分钱也都是我的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1361
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_527abd42:

    # bd "And if you're doing good - and that's a big fucking if..."
    bd "而且如果你表现得不错——这可是一个大写的如果……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1362
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_6e48a94f:

    # bd "...we can work on building back trust between us."
    bd "……我们有机会重建彼此之间的信任。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1363
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_9efa1a1a:

    # bd "You can thank Rox for that. Because if this was anyone but you sitting in front of me..."
    bd "你可以感谢Rox，因为如果坐在我面前的是别人……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1365
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_032e2335:

    # bd "You'd be lying face down in the gutter with a bullet in the back of your fucking skull."
    bd "你他妈的就会躺在污水沟里，脑后插着一颗子弹。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1367
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_13d4aba9:

    # qu "Where's...Riona?"
    qu "Riona在哪？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1371
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_414ce48d:

    # qu "Is she...dead?"
    qu "她……死了吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1373
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_3e0467ec:

    # bd "She suffered, but it was over pretty damned fast."
    bd "她受了苦，但很快就结束了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1375
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_e4869c69:

    # qu "Oh, God..."
    qu "哦，天啊……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1377
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_80682cfe:

    # bd "You really have a soft spot for that bitch."
    bd "你真他妈对那女人上心。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1378
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_f7e76892:

    # bd "Whatever you did with her is history. You hear?"
    bd "不管你对她做了什么，都成了过去式。听到了吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1379
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_2ae9fe4c:

    # bd "You work for me now, which is hilarious because that's what you were supposed to be doing in the first place."
    bd "你现在得为我干活了，这真是个笑点，因为本来你就该这么做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1381
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_36d21d54:

    # bd "Go to your bitch ass friend. She's alive for now."
    bd "去你妈的狗朋友。她现在还活着。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1382
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_d323f8d6:

    # bd "Mick dropped her off at her mom's place."
    bd "Mick把她送回了她妈那儿。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1383
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_eba16618:

    # bd "It's always good to know your customer, right?"
    bd "了解客户总是件好事，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1385
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_df997a3b:

    # qu "What?"
    qu "什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1387
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_5107d992:

    # bd "Bring me the money. All of it. Tonight. I'm done playing games."
    bd "给我把钱带来。全部。今晚。我玩够了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1388
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_edc8eaf9:

    # bd "Let me hear you say it, you fucking rat!"
    bd "让我听听你敢不敢说出口，你这个叛徒。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1390
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_288734a0:

    # qu "I'll bring it. I'll bring it..."
    qu "我会带。我会带……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1409
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_af16d5b1:

    # "*{i}Doorknock{/i}*"
    "*{i}敲门声{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1411
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_ec3df409_1:

    # qu "..."
    qu "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1412
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_b2943013:

    # rim "Who is it?"
    rim "谁啊？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1414
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_e94a101c:

    # qu "It's me. Quinn."
    qu "是我，Quinn。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1420
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_f4e11b3e:

    # qu "Is Riona here?"
    qu "Riona在吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1422
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_7dbe6019:

    # rim "Y-yes."
    rim "嗯。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1423
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_08a43328:

    # rim "Did you...? Did you come alone?"
    rim "你一个人来的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1425
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_314d0a4b:

    # qu "Yes, it's just me."
    qu "是的，就我一个人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1427
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_eb0fb48a:

    # rim "Quinn, what have they done to my girl?"
    rim "Quinn，他们把我女儿怎么了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1428
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_38b47191:

    # rim "I'm too scared to call the police."
    rim "我太害怕报警了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1430
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_4070ef88:

    # qu "Don't involve the police. Things will be fine."
    qu "别报警。一切都会好起来的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1431
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_d4bf9833:

    # qu "Can I see her?"
    qu "能见她一面吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1435
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_8751e20d:

    # qu "Rio...? It's me..."
    qu "里奥娜...？是我..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1437
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_615cc1cd:

    # ri "*{i}Rapid breathing{/i}*"
    ri "*{i}急促呼吸{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1439
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_d60807db:

    # qu "Are you ok?"
    qu "你还好吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1441
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_91ddccc2:

    # ri "*{i}Breathing intensifies{/i}*"
    ri "*{i}呼吸变得急促{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1443
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_7332d159:

    # ri "Do I look fucking ok!?"
    ri "我看起来像他妈没事吗？！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1445
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_ec3df409_2:

    # qu "..."
    qu "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1446
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_937940a1:

    # qu "Rio... What have they done to you?"
    qu "里奥娜... 他们对你做了什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1448
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_494854bc:

    # ri "You said you were protecting me from them."
    ri "你说你是在保护我远离他们。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1449
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_5d0db110:

    # ri "You fucking lied to me... You lied to me."
    ri "你他妈骗了我……你他妈骗了我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1451
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_d86b8725:

    # qu "Rio..."
    qu "里奥娜..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1453
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_4fd4e3f6:

    # ri "I told them everything! Every-fucking-thing!"
    ri "我告诉他们一切！他妈的全部！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1454
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_6bc027bf:

    # ri "And they still did this..."
    ri "他们还是这么做了……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1458
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_83fbe7c9:

    # qu "I'll make them pay for what they did to you."
    qu "我会让他们为他们对你做的事付出代价。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1461
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_5bc4b12b:

    # ri "No, you fucking won't! You're nothing, Quinn! YOU ARE NOTHING!"
    ri "不，你他妈的不会！你什么都不是，Quinn！你他妈的什么都不是！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1463
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_dbb88760:

    # ri "When did you ever have things under control? You never did."
    ri "你什么时候能掌控局面？你从没做到过。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1464
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_0445fda1:

    # ri "All this time, you told me everything was fine and that you could handle it."
    ri "这一路上你一直跟我说一切都没事，说你能应付得了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1465
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_b1e57c64:

    # ri "But you can't handle shit. You're pathetic!"
    ri "可你连屁事都处理不了。你真可悲！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1467
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_c4266179:

    # ri "They threatened me! They threatened Mom!"
    ri "他们威胁我！他们威胁我妈！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1468
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_36aabe8f:

    # ri "This is your fault. All of this is your fucking fault."
    ri "这是你的错。全都是你的错。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1469
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_279645a6:

    # ri "And I'm so fucking done with you. Do you hear me!?"
    ri "我他妈真的受够你了。你听到了吗！？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1472
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_abb1310e:

    # ri "I'M DONE!"
    ri "我完了！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1478
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_80dc8801:

    # ri "Don't ever talk to me again."
    ri "别再跟我说话了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1479
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_6ae9391e:

    # ri "Get the fuck away from me before they come after Mom too."
    ri "快他妈的离我远点，不然他们也会来找妈妈的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1486
translate schinese ep11_quinn_dt_label_ec3df409_3:

    # qu "..."
    qu "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1516
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_8276d2ea:

    # qu "What's an ermine?"
    qu "什么玩意儿？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1518
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_fd7974da:

    # rx "It's an animal - like a weasel."
    rx "这是一种动物——像黄鼠狼。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1520
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_d04c6449:

    # qu "Like a rat? Why do you have rats tattooed on your face?"
    qu "像老鼠？你为什么脸上纹的是老鼠？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1522
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_594e9a75:

    # rx "Hold on. Rats? We need to set this shit straight."
    rx "等一下。老鼠？我们得把这事弄清楚。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1523
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_7ff487ed:

    # rx "Gimme a second. I need my book."
    rx "给我一分钟，我需要我的书。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1528
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_3e7e8d11:

    # rx "Here. I got this book from my mother. When I was a kid, she used to tell me a buncha stories, and there's one that always stuck with me."
    rx "这里。我从我妈那儿弄来的这本书。小时候她总给我讲一堆故事，其中有一个一直记在我心里。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1533
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_9e9aa6c1:

    # rx "Look. This is an ermine. Does that look like a rat to you?"
    rx "看清楚。这是雪貂。你觉得它像老鼠吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1535
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_2949c8b7:

    # qu "Wow... It's so cute. And white."
    qu "哇……好可爱，还是白色的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1536
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_766f921a:

    # rx "Don't be fooled by its appearance."
    rx "别被它看起来的样子骗了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1537
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_84043e3f:

    # rx "This animal is a vicious predator."
    rx "这种动物是凶猛的捕食者。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1538
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_0a05c16e:

    # rx "While you think it looks like a fucking rat, in reality..."
    rx "虽然你觉得它看起来像他妈的老鼠，但事实上……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1541
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_9dae90ec:

    # rx "It's a rat killer!"
    rx "它是鼠类杀手！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1542
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_5598df7c:

    # rx "It sneaks up on its prey at night and attacks it from behind."
    rx "它晚上偷偷靠近猎物，从背后发起攻击。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1543
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_6be63921:

    # rx "It bites its victim with its sharp teeth repeatedly in the neck until it dies."
    rx "它用尖牙反复咬住猎物的脖子，直到猎物死去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1544
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_a09413bf:

    # qu "Wow..."
    qu "哇..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1546
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_3ddc4a8c:

    # rx "Way back in time, this symbol of the ermine meant authority."
    rx "很久以前，这种水獭的图腾代表着权威。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1547
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_2b44e2a1:

    # rx "Powerful people, to be feared and respected, wore them."
    rx "有权势的人，令人畏惧又敬重，他们戴着这个。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1550
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_95eda6fe:

    # rx "Humans hunted the ermine for its fur."
    rx "人类为了它的皮毛而猎杀水貂。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1551
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_5fa888a2:

    # rx "They wanted to make majestic coats out of the ermine fur - high-quality shit."
    rx "他们想用雪貂皮做华丽的外套——他妈的高档货。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1552
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_1e9a1c34:

    # qu "It's running away from them!"
    qu "它在逃开！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1553
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_4cbb4e03:

    # rx "Yes, but..."
    rx "是的，但..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1556
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_f73e2c54:

    # rx "The ermine would rather risk its life and die than run through mud and sully its white fur coat."
    rx "水獭宁可豁出性命、死在泥里，也不愿让沾了泥的白毛毁了它的体面。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1557
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_0b2a86d8:

    # rx "Now, that's bravery. And that's pride."
    rx "现在，这才是勇气。这才是骄傲。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1558
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_b65784a0:

    # qu "Is that true?"
    qu "这是真的吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1559
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_6257e64d:

    # rx "It's a legend, and legends usually sound better than reality. But I've always found the legend cool as fuck."
    rx "这是一则传说，而传说通常听起来比现实更酷。但我觉得这传说他妈的真他妈酷。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1562
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_dbf3f939:

    # rx "You see, in this world, you and me - us - we are the little guys."
    rx "你看，这世上，你我——我们，就是那小人物。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1563
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_b75a5582:

    # rx "We aren't like the rest out there."
    rx "我们跟那些人不一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1565
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_603ed474:

    # rx "They sit in their ivory towers with fancy cars, money, and jobs. And they look down on us for being who we are born to be."
    rx "他们坐在自己的象牙塔里，开着豪车，有钱有工作。他们看不起我们，因为我们就是生来如此。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1566
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_0cc3389a:

    # rx "And even though we are the little guys doing what we can to survive, bigger predators hunt us and want to see us dead for what we do."
    rx "尽管我们只是那些努力求生的小人物，但更大的掠食者却想看到我们死，因为他们对我们所做的事充满敌意。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1568
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_182df19e:

    # rx "That's why we hunt at night, too. We need to be as cunning, fast, and aggressive as the ermine."
    rx "这也是为什么我们晚上也出来活动。我们要和雪貂一样，机灵、敏捷、狠辣。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1570
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_145d6af3:

    # rx "Q. Always be brave. Always have pride."
    rx "勇敢到底，永远骄傲。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1574
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_170b35d6:

    # rx "How about it? Does it still sound like I have a cute animal tattooed on my face?"
    rx "怎么样？这还像不像我脸上纹了个可爱的小动物？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1577
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_3fffe3b2:

    # qu "Nuh-uh."
    qu "嗯。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1579
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_8a7eb93d:

    # rx "Good. Don't you ever forget it."
    rx "好。别忘了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1591
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_586e9445:

    # qu "That's all of it."
    qu "那就是全部了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1593
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_6de5386b:

    # bd "Looks like you've been busy."
    bd "看起来你最近挺忙的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1594
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_581f0a04:

    # bd "But how can I trust it's everything when your friend tells me otherwise?"
    bd "但你朋友跟我说了别的，我怎么知道你给的就全是真的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1596
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_33135229:

    # qu "It is everything I have. If Rio said anything else, she'd be talking out of her ass. I kept this money from her."
    qu "这就是我的全部家当。里奥娜要是说了别的，就是在胡扯。这笔钱我一直瞒着她。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1597
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_5c0c6adf:

    # qu "If you want me to continue to sell for you, I need some of it back for my expenses."
    qu "如果你还想让我替你卖货，就得给我留一部分钱补贴开销。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1599
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_8979767d:

    # bd "Hahaha!"
    bd "哈哈哈！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1600
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_2fbdebbb:

    # bd "The fucking nerve on you."
    bd "你他妈的胆子也太大了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1602
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_d8bd8006:

    # bd "Who are you? You're not the crying bitch who left here a couple of hours ago."
    bd "你是谁？你不是刚才哭着离开这儿的那个婊子。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1604
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_84147b35:

    # vi "She was crying?"
    vi "她是在哭？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1606
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_2cb4062c:

    # bd "Shut the fuck up."
    bd "闭嘴。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1611
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_7b8413cb:

    # bd "I was half-expecting you to skip town, but you seem to be smarter than that."
    bd "我本来还想着你可能会跑掉，但你看起来比那聪明多了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1612
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_4523e074:

    # bd "Well... You gotta spend money to make money."
    bd "要赚到钱，就得花点钱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1614
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_bd9de03d:

    # bd "Here. I'm feeling generous. The jacked-up prices put me in a good mood."
    bd "这里。我今天心情不错，就多给点。那些天价让我感觉挺爽的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1616
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_70a95bb5:

    # qu "I don't want to do this, but I'll do this for you if you never hurt my friend ever again."
    qu "我不想做这事儿，但如果你以后再也不要伤害我的朋友，我就会帮你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1618
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_ae6277be:

    # bd "Another demand? You're getting greedy."
    bd "又来一个要求？你这是贪心了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1619
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_d5cddc8f:

    # bd "You're not in a place to make any fucking demands."
    bd "你他妈别在这儿提什么条件。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1623
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_03eabc41:

    # bd "Sell the fucking drugs. Bring me the money. And I won't hurt anyone you love."
    bd "卖毒品。给我钱。然后我就不伤害你爱的人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1624
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_dce95e70:

    # bd "Now, fuck off."
    bd "现在滚蛋。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1629
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_03fb167b:

    # qu "About those increased prices... Who do you think gave me that idea?"
    qu "关于那些涨价的事……你觉得是谁给我这个主意的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1630
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_d1288423:

    # qu "Blood and dirt are not the only things you have to clean up here. You've got an infestation."
    qu "血和脏东西不是你在这里唯一需要清理的。你还有个虫子窝。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1643
translate schinese ep11_quinn_story_label_5c8c4812:

    # bd "{i}Sell the fucking drugs. Bring me the money. And I won't hurt anyone you love.{/i}"
    bd "{i}卖掉那该死的毒品。把钱给我。我不会伤害你爱的人。{/i}"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1666
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_feaca749:

    # ty "Ahhh!!! Get out!"
    ty "啊！！！滚出去！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1668
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_7936ab14:

    # ty "Jiiiiill!!!"
    ty "吉——尔！！！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1672
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_8e963cdf:

    # ty "It's noooot whaaat it looooks liiike."
    ty "这不是看起来那样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1690
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_c5343874:

    # ty "Nooo..."
    ty "不..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:1693
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_71c37e21:

    # ty "NOOOOOOOOOOO!!!"
    ty "不！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1701
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_0032200c:

    # ty "No! Jill! No!!!"
    ty "不！Jill！不！！！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1708
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_82e257b0:

    # ty "Ahhh!!!"
    ty "啊啊啊！！！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1712
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_59702d52:

    # nu "Tybalt? What's wrong?"
    nu "Tybalt？怎么了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1714
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_c2e1ef0f:

    # ty "It hurts!"
    ty "好痛！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1716
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_0bf1dcf2:

    # nu "Try not to move around too much."
    nu "尽量别乱动。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1717
translate schinese ep11_tyb_label_187d1520:

    # nu "It was a nasty tear in your scrotum. It will take a couple of weeks for the wound to heal."
    nu "这是你阴囊上撕裂的伤口，得过几周才能愈合。"

