    # dad "Haha! He does look worried, doesn't he?"
    dad "哈哈！他看起来确实挺担心的，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1920
translate schinese ep11_home_label_568b7142:

    # mc "I'm starting to regret this already."
    mc "我现在就开始后悔了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1922
translate schinese ep11_home_label_14f0f66b:

    # dad "Don't worry. I'll try my best not to scare her away."
    dad "别担心。我会尽量别把她吓跑。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1923
translate schinese ep11_home_label_0db9d107:

    # dad "Why don't you show Sage around while I finish in the kitchen? I'm almost done."
    dad "我把厨房收拾完时，你带Sage四处看看怎么样？我马上就好。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1925
translate schinese ep11_home_label_d1be8d14_1:

    # mc "Sure, we can do that. Let's head upstairs."
    mc "好，我们这就上去吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1927
translate schinese ep11_home_label_32bb5378:

    # dad "What a lovely girl you've found yourself, son. She seems like a hoot."
    dad "这可真是个可爱的女孩，儿子。她看起来挺有意思的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1929
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e38e977a_1:

    # mc "Thanks, Dad. I'm so happy with her."
    mc "谢谢爸。我跟她在一起真的很开心。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1931
translate schinese ep11_home_label_3b89f387_1:

    # mc "Oh, it looks like Dad brought some new furniture home. That's nice."
    mc "哦，看来我爸带了些新家具回家。这挺不错的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1932
translate schinese ep11_home_label_2087b496_1:

    # mc "It didn't look like this last time I was home."
    mc "上次我回家的时候可没这副模样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1934
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e1ff5170:

    # sa "At least it took him a while to change the place. My parents turned my room into a home library the moment I moved out."
    sa "至少他花了不少时间才把这地方改头换面。我爸妈在我搬出去后第一时间就把我的房间改成了家庭图书馆。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1936
translate schinese ep11_home_label_ea5521a7:

    # mc "They did?"
    mc "他们真的这么做了吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1938
translate schinese ep11_home_label_d20c5266:

    # sa "Yup. They had my things boxed up and stored away by my first visit back home."
    sa "嗯，他们在我第一次回家的时候就把我的东西打包收起来了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1940
translate schinese ep11_home_label_91027306:

    # mc "Oof... How did that feel?"
    mc "哎哟...那感觉怎么样？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1942
translate schinese ep11_home_label_6d282b50:

    # sa "Not too good. It was as if it was final. Like, there's no going back now."
    sa "不太好了。感觉一切都已经定下来了，就像再也回不去了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1944
translate schinese ep11_home_label_3a2c9705:

    # mc "Anyway... Behind you, that's the bathroom, if you need to use it. It's in better shape than the rest of the house."
    mc "总之……你身后是卫生间，要用的话就在那儿。那里比房子其他地方好一些。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1945
translate schinese ep11_home_label_90834e33:

    # mc "Dad has been doing some renovations here and there whenever he gets scraps from work."
    mc "老爸最近抽空在这里这儿那儿做些翻新，反正他手头有工作上的零碎活儿。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1946
translate schinese ep11_home_label_560752a8_1:

    # mc "But it's going slow because he doesn't want to feel like he's working all day and night."
    mc "不过进展有点慢，因为他不想感觉像是整天整夜都在干活。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1948
translate schinese ep11_home_label_7cdbe758:

    # sa "That sounds healthy if you ask me."
    sa "这听起来挺健康的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1950
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b58288e9:

    # mc "This is my room. Um..."
    mc "这是我的房间。嗯……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1951
translate schinese ep11_home_label_71f4395d:

    # mc "I brought some stuff with me when I left for college, that's why it's empty."
    mc "我来上学的时候带了一些东西，所以这里空着。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1953
translate schinese ep11_home_label_ec2fad5a_1:

    # mc "It's usually not a mess. I guess that's how I left it."
    mc "通常不会乱七八糟的。我想大概就是我离开时留下的样子。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1955
translate schinese ep11_home_label_1d98f99e:

    # sa "To be fair, your room at the DIKs used to be way worse than this."
    sa "说句实话，你在DIKs们的房间以前可比这糟糕多了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1957
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e5a2a46b:

    # mc "Thanks for being cool about it. I know this room isn't much."
    mc "谢谢你的理解。我知道这间屋子没什么特别的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1959
translate schinese ep11_home_label_20dfddef:

    # sa "It has what a room needs."
    sa "它有房间该有的东西。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1961
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c2552506:

    # mc "Barely."
    mc "勉强算吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1963
translate schinese ep11_home_label_9bb07ed6:

    # sa "Haha, well, I like it."
    sa "哈哈，我挺喜欢的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1965
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b6d5c2f7:

    # mc "No, you don't. There's not much to like about it. Just say it sucks."
    mc "不，你没必要这么想。这地方也没什么好喜欢的。直接说它烂就行了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1967
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b03d6a09:

    # sa "Would that make you feel better?"
    sa "这会让你感觉好点吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1969
translate schinese ep11_home_label_898322db:

    # mc "I feel weird trying to show this off to you as if it's something special."
    mc "我觉得有点别扭，想向你炫耀一下这房间，好像它有什么特别的地方。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1971
translate schinese ep11_home_label_6dd01ccf:

    # sa "Well, you grew up and made memories in here."
    sa "嗯，你在这里长大，也在这里留下了回忆。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1972
translate schinese ep11_home_label_f6750c93:

    # sa "Sure, it doesn't look like much, but knowing this is where you spent your childhood makes it a special room."
    sa "当然，看起来没什么特别的，但知道这是你小时候待过的地方，这间屋子就变得特别了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1973
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fedf080e:

    # sa "I'm happy you showed it to me."
    sa "我高兴你带我来看看。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1975
translate schinese ep11_home_label_264cf1f7:

    # mc "You're right. It is a special room."
    mc "你说得对，这间屋子确实有特别的意义。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1977
translate schinese ep11_home_label_444019a4:

    # sa "There you go."
    sa "这就对了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1979
translate schinese ep11_home_label_db2ffca3:

    # sa "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    sa "*{i}一巴掌{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1982
translate schinese ep11_home_label_af16d5b1_1:

    # "*{i}Doorknock{/i}*"
    "*{i}敲门声{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1984
translate schinese ep11_home_label_3e0c750b_1:

    # dad "It's been a while since I had to knock on this door."
    dad "这扇门我上次敲还是好一阵子以前的事了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1985
translate schinese ep11_home_label_778396b6_1:

    # dad "I was never quite sure what I'd walk in on."
    dad "我从没确定自己会撞见什么。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1987
translate schinese ep11_home_label_7ed32306_1:

    # mc "Dad!"
    mc "爸爸！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1989
translate schinese ep11_home_label_8665d88f:

    # sa "Haha! That's why I always knock when I visit him, too."
    sa "哈哈！这也是为什么我每次去他家都先敲门的原因。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1991
translate schinese ep11_home_label_ad605de3_1:

    # dad "Dinner is ready."
    dad "晚饭好了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:1998
translate schinese ep11_home_label_ade38201:

    # mc "Dad, I'm home."
    mc "爸，我回来了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2000
translate schinese ep11_home_label_80963ccd:

    # dad "Took you long enough. Was the train not on time?"
    dad "来得还挺晚的，火车没准点吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2002
translate schinese ep11_home_label_16d0820e:

    # mc "Just a slight delay. Lots of people were traveling today. How are you?"
    mc "只是稍微晚了点。今天很多人在出行。你怎么样？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2004
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a9711214:

    # dad "I'm doing well. But I want to hear all about what's up with you."
    dad "我挺好的。但我想听听你最近都经历了什么。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2006
translate schinese ep11_home_label_6fa47819:

    # mc "Where do I even start...?"
    mc "我该从哪儿说起呢……？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2008
translate schinese ep11_home_label_4a720f1e:

    # dad "Let's start with food. I hope you're hungry; I'm finishing up in the kitchen."
    dad "我们先从吃饭开始。希望你饿了，我在厨房快弄好了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2010
translate schinese ep11_home_label_28bccbe9:

    # mc "Great! Need a hand?"
    mc "好啊！需要帮忙吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2018
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fe9e3b77:

    # dad "..."
    dad "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2020
translate schinese ep11_home_label_5d17b2b9:

    # dad "I'm speechless..."
    dad "我说不出话了..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2027
translate schinese ep11_home_label_adcf8c97:

    # mc "I know. That's why I couldn't be here with you yesterday."
    mc "我知道。这就是为什么我昨天没法陪你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2029
translate schinese ep11_home_label_805382d5:

    # dad "Did it work out ok?"
    dad "这事儿搞定了吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2037
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fc44609f:

    # mc "We found a way to help her with one of her problems, but not all of them."
    mc "我们找到了一种方法能帮她解决其中一个问题，但不是全部。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2038
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c3d1326b:

    # mc "I don't know how to handle her being abused by her dad."
    mc "我不知道该怎么处理她被爸爸虐待的事情。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2039
translate schinese ep11_home_label_62b90991:

    # mc "I don't even get how she handles it."
    mc "我甚至搞不懂她是怎么应付的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2041
translate schinese ep11_home_label_3c54af81:

    # mc "No, nothing did. But Maya says she's fine with it."
    mc "不，什么都没解决。但Maya说她能接受。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2042
translate schinese ep11_home_label_613d00cc:

    # mc "How can she be fine with it?"
    mc "她是怎么做到没事的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2050
translate schinese ep11_home_label_179ca66d:

    # mc "I can't imagine being in her spot."
    mc "我根本想象不到自己处在她的位置。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2051
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e14ec46c:

    # mc "That's like if you would abuse me. I feel bad saying those words."
    mc "这就像你去虐待我一样。我说出这些话都觉得心里难受。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2054
translate schinese ep11_home_label_0fff9d81:

    # dad "Is there anything you can do to help her with that? What about filing a report against her dad?"
    dad "你还有什么办法能帮她吗？要不要去告她爸爸？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2056
translate schinese ep11_home_label_78a5185f:

    # dad "Is there anything else you can do to help her? What about filing a report against her dad?"
    dad "还有别的办法能帮她吗？要不要去告她爸爸？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2063
translate schinese ep11_home_label_7997c90e:

    # mc "Maya says she couldn't because - like it or not - her dad is basically what keeps her mom alive."
    mc "Maya说她不能离开，因为不管愿不愿意承认，她爸基本上维系着她妈的生命。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2064
translate schinese ep11_home_label_672ef2b5:

    # mc "She cares so much about her mom's well-being that she'd even put up with those things for her."
    mc "她这么在乎她妈妈的健康，甚至为了她能忍受那些事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2066
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c80fd3d7:

    # dad "It sounds like she had to grow up awfully fast."
    dad "听起来她小时候就不得不早早长大。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2073
translate schinese ep11_home_label_1e762b31:

    # mc "Yeah, and her brother, too."
    mc "对，还有她哥哥。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2075
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b4b71d15:

    # dad "And so did you."
    dad "所以你也一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2076
translate schinese ep11_home_label_5383520a:

    # dad "I wish I could have let you be a kid for longer, but what you said about Patrick not having it easy raising them..."
    dad "我希望我能让你多当会几年小孩，但你刚才说的，Patrick一个人带你们俩也不容易..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2077
translate schinese ep11_home_label_87c89576:

    # dad "...I can relate to that."
    dad "我能理解那种感觉。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2084
translate schinese ep11_home_label_92448096:

    # mc "Dad, you did amazing on your own."
    mc "老爸，你一个人干得真棒。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2086
translate schinese ep11_home_label_03d9aab9:

    # dad "No, I didn't. It's...been hard. And I've made a lot of mistakes."
    dad "不，我没这么做。那段时间……挺难的。我也犯了很多错。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2093
translate schinese ep11_home_label_672087df:

    # mc "You never resorted to violence. Hell, you rarely got mad at me."
    mc "你从没用暴力解决问题。该死，你很少对我发火。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2094
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b44d90fe:

    # mc "I'm telling you, you did great."
    mc "我跟你说，你做得很好。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2096
translate schinese ep11_home_label_70a4386f:

    # dad "I didn't do great every day."
    dad "我没每天都很出色。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2103
translate schinese ep11_home_label_990d6399:

    # mc "Every day that mattered, you did."
    mc "每一天都算数的时候，你都做得很好。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2105
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fe9e3b77_1:

    # dad "..."
    dad "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2108
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c4cf7521:

    # dad "I'm sorry. Perhaps this is a bad conversation to have when your girlfriend is home with you."
    dad "抱歉，或许现在和你女朋友在家的时候谈这个话题不太合适。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2111
translate schinese ep11_home_label_323b8b13:

    # sa "Not at all. Don't stop yourself if you have things to say."
    sa "一点都不用。如果你有话想说，别停下。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2112
translate schinese ep11_home_label_042bb1da:

    # sa "I couldn't talk about tough topics with my family; this is refreshing to see."
    sa "我以前没法和家人谈这种沉重的话题，看到你们能这样交流，感觉很新鲜。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2115
translate schinese ep11_home_label_be99c699:

    # ji "Please, don't feel that way for my sake."
    ji "请别为我这样想。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2122
translate schinese ep11_home_label_44634dcf:

    # mc "We can move on from it..."
    mc "我们可以继续聊点别的……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2125
translate schinese ep11_home_label_844e79d1:

    # mc "I love what you did with the place..."
    mc "我喜欢你把这儿弄成这番样子……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2127
translate schinese ep11_home_label_2ce87140:

    # dad "Heh. You do? Doesn't the furniture make it look like a hotel?"
    dad "呵，你真这么觉得？这些家具看起来不像酒店里的吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2128
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e41b83ef:

    # mc "No hotel I've ever been to."
    mc "我没去过哪家酒店能比得上这个。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2130
translate schinese ep11_home_label_6230e08e:

    # dad "The hotel bed I brought home is the best bed I've ever slept in."
    dad "我带回家的那张酒店床是睡过最好的床。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2131
translate schinese ep11_home_label_39d50748:

    # dad "It hurt my back the first few nights, but some light yoga helped sort that out."
    dad "前几晚睡得腰酸背痛，不过做点轻柔的瑜伽缓解了一下。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2134
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b96249ce:

    # ji "Do you like yoga, too?"
    ji "你喜欢瑜伽吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2136
translate schinese ep11_home_label_d4821a47:

    # dad "My body and mind like it very much. That and meditation - you know, simple breathing exercises? How about you?"
    dad "我的身体和精神都很喜欢。还有冥想，你知道的，就是简单的呼吸练习？你呢？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2138
translate schinese ep11_home_label_42fd62c7:

    # ji "Oh, I couldn't agree more. I enjoy it a lot and have tried to get [name] to enjoy it more with me."
    ji "哦，我完全同意。我很享受，也一直想让[name]和我一起体会其中的乐趣。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2140
translate schinese ep11_home_label_721d6fab:

    # dad "I'm happy you have common interests. Not that I'd say yoga is one of his."
    dad "我很高兴你也有共同的兴趣。不过我可没说瑜伽是他喜欢的东西。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2141
translate schinese ep11_home_label_dd7378ac:

    # dad "Stretching after sparring sessions was pretty much what he'd agree to do with me."
    dad "和我一起做拉伸运动，那大概是他能接受的极限了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2143
translate schinese ep11_home_label_544b1720:

    # mc "So, you're into yoga these days?"
    mc "所以你现在也喜欢瑜伽了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2146
translate schinese ep11_home_label_4cf120b2:

    # mc "Are you doing yoga these days?"
    mc "你现在在练瑜伽吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2148
translate schinese ep11_home_label_29c54e08:

    # dad "I needed something to stay in shape after I lost my sparring partner."
    dad "我需要一些东西来保持身材，自从我失去了我的格斗搭档之后。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2150
translate schinese ep11_home_label_14374e1f:

    # mc "Like your work doesn't keep you in shape."
    mc "像你的工作没法让你保持身材。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2153
translate schinese ep11_home_label_797d336b:

    # dad "It does, but my muscles are like old rubber bands at my age. They need this kind of exercise."
    dad "它确实有帮助，但我的肌肉就像我这个年纪的旧橡皮筋一样。这种锻炼对我来说是必要的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2154
translate schinese ep11_home_label_d557a064:

    # dad "Are you two taking yoga classes together?"
    dad "你们俩是不是一起上瑜伽课的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2156
translate schinese ep11_home_label_5f7a7950:

    # mc "I tagged along to one, but it wasn't the best for me."
    mc "我跟着一起去了一次，但那对我不太合适。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2158
translate schinese ep11_home_label_0246830d:

    # ji "It wasn't proper exercise for him."
    ji "这对他来说不算正经锻炼。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2160
translate schinese ep11_home_label_341b04d7:

    # dad "[name]... You didn't say that, did you?"
    dad "[name]……你没说那种话吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2162
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a9e8b236:

    # mc "Well, it's not. I didn't get tired from it."
    mc "好吧，这根本不算锻炼。我根本没觉得累。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2164
translate schinese ep11_home_label_1a254f7c:

    # dad "*{i}Sigh{/i}* [name]..."
    dad "*{i}叹气{/i}* [name]..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2166
translate schinese ep11_home_label_d3cca7a9:

    # ji "That's not always the point with exercise."
    ji "那可不一定是锻炼的目的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2168
translate schinese ep11_home_label_bd7d2eea:

    # mc "To me, it is."
    mc "对我而言，就是这样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2170
translate schinese ep11_home_label_304f06d3:

    # mc "At the gym, I met this guy who's a personal trainer, and he helps me out with sparring."
    mc "在健身房我遇到一个私人教练，他帮我一起练格斗。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2173
translate schinese ep11_home_label_53ee9722:

    # dad "It does, but my mind needed some mental exercise, too. I've been meditating as well."
    dad "它确实如此，但我的脑子也需要一些精神上的锻炼。我也在冥想。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2178
translate schinese ep11_home_label_2b57a9bd:

    # mc "That's funny. I've been doing yoga, too. I tagged along to it, at least."
    mc "这挺有意思。我也有在练瑜伽，至少我跟着一起去了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2179
translate schinese ep11_home_label_50ac76ac:

    # mc "And now, at the gym, I've met this guy who's a personal trainer, and he helps me out with sparring."
    mc "现在在健身房，我认识了一个私人教练，他帮我一起训练格斗。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2182
translate schinese ep11_home_label_1fc99daf:

    # dad "I'm happy you're still practicing it."
    dad "我很高兴你还在坚持练习。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2184
translate schinese ep11_home_label_68a0c7f3:

    # mc "Me too. I'm having so much fun, Dad."
    mc "我也是。我玩得挺开心的，老爸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2185
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c7da6dc6:

    # mc "There are highs and lows of being in college, but with everything combined, I'm enjoying it a lot."
    mc "大学里有高低起伏，但把一切都混在一起，我过得挺开心的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2187
translate schinese ep11_home_label_af1aa69c:

    # dad "There are highs and lows to everything in life, son. It's because of it life is worth living."
    dad "人生总有高低起伏，儿子。正因为如此，生活才值得过下去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2191
translate schinese ep11_home_label_723edc84:

    # mc "Another high in my life that I gotta tell you about... Um..."
    mc "又一个我得跟你说的生活高光时刻……呃……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2192
translate schinese ep11_home_label_bc503643:

    # mc "I'm in a relationship, Dad. Or better said, I'm in two relationships."
    mc "我在谈恋爱，爸爸。或者说，我正在和两个人谈恋爱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2193
translate schinese ep11_home_label_96adc0e7:

    # mc "Wait... Maybe that's not better."
    mc "等等……也许这样说并不更好。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2195
translate schinese ep11_home_label_991642e2:

    # dad "Did you find yourself a girlfriend?"
    dad "你找到女朋友了吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2197
translate schinese ep11_home_label_7bf74799:

    # mc "Um... Girlfriends."
    mc "嗯……女朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2199
translate schinese ep11_home_label_161b59a1:

    # dad "Multiple?"
    dad "多个？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2201
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c6318ab0:

    # mc "Two, to be precise."
    mc "确切地说是两个。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2203
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e30ca154:

    # dad "Son... You can't have two girlfriends."
    dad "儿子...你不能有俩女朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2204
translate schinese ep11_home_label_31ba83dc:

    # dad "Aren't you thinking about their well-being?"
    dad "你是不是在想她们的感受？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2206
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a184c70d:

    # mc "It's not like that. We're all dating each other."
    mc "不是这样的。我们都在互相约会。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2208
translate schinese ep11_home_label_ab7d4ad0:

    # dad "What...does that mean?"
    dad "那……是什么意思？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2210
translate schinese ep11_home_label_294a997f:

    # mc "Maya - the girl I just told you about - is one of them. And remember that girl I worked with this summer?"
    mc "Maya ——我刚刚跟你说的那个女孩——就是其中一个。还记得我这个夏天一起工作的那个女孩吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2212
translate schinese ep11_home_label_15bf2610:

    # dad "Uh... Jody, right?"
    dad "呃...乔迪，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2215
translate schinese ep11_home_label_27ddc56c:

    # mc "No, that's my name. It is Josy."
    mc "不，那是我的名字。我叫Josy。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2217
translate schinese ep11_home_label_705b3588:

    # mc "No, Josy."
    mc "不，Josy。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2219
translate schinese ep11_home_label_6a9b07b3:

    # dad "Oh, was that it?"
    dad "哦，原来如此？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2221
translate schinese ep11_home_label_cb934e08:

    # mc "Yeah. It's them."
    mc "对，就是她们。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2223
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fe9e3b77_2:

    # dad "..."
    dad "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2225
translate schinese ep11_home_label_2a9b21b7:

    # mc "Look, I can hear that it sounds weird when I'm explaining it to you."
    mc "听着，我明白跟你解释的时候听起来可能有点奇怪。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2227
translate schinese ep11_home_label_4bab13d2:

    # dad "Son... *{i}Sigh{/i}* What you do with your life is your business. I can't tell you what to do and what not to do."
    dad "儿子……*{i}叹气{/i}* 你的人生怎么过是你的事。我无权对你指手画脚。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2228
translate schinese ep11_home_label_62d0d69b:

    # dad "I can only give you advice along the way."
    dad "我只能在你路上给你一些建议。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2229
translate schinese ep11_home_label_5d3c62b2:

    # dad "I've also been young and done some questionable things, and I regret many mistakes."
    dad "我年轻的时候也做过一些见不得光的事，也后悔过不少错误。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2231
translate schinese ep11_home_label_f0151c06:

    # mc "Dad... Josy and Maya aren't mistakes, nor are they questionable things. They are my girlfriends."
    mc "爸爸... Josy 和 Maya 不是错误，也不是什么可疑的事。她们是我的女朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2233
translate schinese ep11_home_label_9ed7ea7e:

    # dad "I'm only saying that this Maya girl seems to have a lot on her plate as it is."
    dad "我只说这叫Maya的姑娘现在就够操心的了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2234
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a8712a56:

    # dad "Don't go breaking her heart by having another girlfriend."
    dad "别让她的心碎了，别又搞个女朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2236
translate schinese ep11_home_label_0004abd9:

    # mc "Dad, I'm telling you it's not like that."
    mc "爸，我跟你说，不是那样的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2237
translate schinese ep11_home_label_addfff8f:

    # mc "We're all together in a relationship and we're ok with it."
    mc "我们都在一段关系里，而且我们接受这样的关系。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2239
translate schinese ep11_home_label_29ed2d28:

    # dad "Son... Two girls and a guy... It sounds like fun, but it doesn't sound like a relationship."
    dad "儿子...两个女孩加一个男孩...听起来挺好玩的，但听起来不像一段感情。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2241
translate schinese ep11_home_label_62a18f9d:

    # mc "Stop being old-fashioned. It is a relationship and we're all in it."
    mc "别老土了。这本身就是一段关系，我们都在里面。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2243
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e0f8239e:

    # dad "When I was young, I also had my eyes on multiple women. I know all there is about temptation and that choosing can be hard."
    dad "年轻的时候，我也有过同时喜欢多个女生的时候。我知道诱惑是什么感觉，也知道做选择真的很难。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2244
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a92290c4:

    # dad "I don't want you to hurt those girls that you care about."
    dad "我不想你伤害那些你关心的女孩。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2246
translate schinese ep11_home_label_f915ac3f:

    # mc "I'm not. Ok?"
    mc "我不是。好吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2248
translate schinese ep11_home_label_f3a22ec2:

    # dad "I'm sorry. I should have kept my mouth shut."
    dad "对不起。我本该闭嘴的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2250
translate schinese ep11_home_label_726496db:

    # mc "I wanted to bring you happy news, but now I feel bad about it."
    mc "我想给你带个好消息，但现在感觉有点糟。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2251
translate schinese ep11_home_label_279c2ac2:

    # mc "You always told me to follow my heart and this is where it's at, Dad."
    mc "你一直跟我说要跟着自己的心走，现在这情况就是最好的证明，老爸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2253
translate schinese ep11_home_label_0dee57b4:

    # dad "Are you telling me that you love these girls equally much and that they feel the same on their end?"
    dad "你是在跟我说你爱这些女孩一样多，而且她们也是一样爱你吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2255
translate schinese ep11_home_label_9e9d8537:

    # mc "I don't know how they feel..."
    mc "我不知道她们心里是怎么想的……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2257
translate schinese ep11_home_label_531baaa4:

    # dad "Relationships are hard. And if there's something I've learned, many women say one thing when they mean another."
    dad "关系很难搞。如果我有什么学到的，那就是很多女人说的和想的不一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2258
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a6ee03ae:

    # dad "And we men can have a hard time reading the signals that women send us."
    dad "而且我们男人在解读女人给的信号时也很难。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2260
translate schinese ep11_home_label_74eb35b7:

    # dad "Just because a woman says they are fine doesn't necessarily mean that they are. You have to stop at that moment and consider if that's how they truly feel."
    dad "正因为一个女人说她没事，不等于她真的没事。你得在那一刻停下来想想，她是不是真的这么想。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2261
translate schinese ep11_home_label_bd7db9fd:

    # dad "And they might go along with something you want, for your sake, but not for them. And this can happen without you even realizing it."
    dad "她们可能会为了你好而顺从你的想法，但并不是出于她们自己的意愿。而这种情况，可能在你毫无察觉的情况下就已经发生了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2263
translate schinese ep11_home_label_386fb569:

    # mc "Let's drop this. You obviously don't understand anything."
    mc "我们别谈这个了。你明显什么都不懂。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2265
translate schinese ep11_home_label_78104f3f:

    # dad "Dammit, I've made it worse."
    dad "该死，我反而弄糟了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2267
translate schinese ep11_home_label_941065ff:

    # mc "I have two girlfriends. You can think whatever you want about it, but that's what it is. You have to find a way to be ok with it."
    mc "我有两个女朋友。你可以怎么想都行，但这就是事实。你得想办法接受这个现实。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2269
translate schinese ep11_home_label_aa398028:

    # dad "Son..."
    dad "儿子..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2271
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b29f41b4:

    # dad "I'm sorry. I hear you."
    dad "对不起。我明白你的感受。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2272
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a1dcef97:

    # dad "Forgive me for being too blunt."
    dad "对不起，我太直白了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2274
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fe9e3b77_3:

    # dad "..."
    dad "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:2279
translate schinese ep11_home_label_ae84897f:

    # sa "I see where you get it from now. You two are so much alike."
    sa "我现在明白你从哪儿来的了。你们俩简直一模一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2281
translate schinese ep11_home_label_379fcd6e:

    # mc "You think?"
    mc "你这么想？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2283
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a84ea7b8:

    # sa "Totally."
    sa "完全同意。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2285
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fa9ef83a:

    # dad "We're not completely alike. I've got the looks in the family."
    dad "我们也不完全一样，咱家就数我最帅。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2287
translate schinese ep11_home_label_871b714b:

    # sa "Hahaha!"
    sa "哈哈哈！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2289
translate schinese ep11_home_label_0126e082_2:

    # mc "Dad..."
    mc "爸爸……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2291
translate schinese ep11_home_label_f302bfab:

    # sa "And the humor, too."
    sa "还有这幽默感。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2292
translate schinese ep11_home_label_137861d8:

    # sa "I'm sure you have a fun story about [name] you'd wanna share with me."
    sa "你肯定知道不少[name]的趣事，快讲一个给我听听。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2294
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c6ccc515:

    # dad "Oh, do I ever?"
    dad "哦，我可太有故事了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2296
translate schinese ep11_home_label_de4cd047:

    # mc "Dad. No."
    mc "爸爸。不。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2298
translate schinese ep11_home_label_7495d3fd:

    # sa "Pay him no attention. It's story time."
    sa "别理他。故事时间。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2300
translate schinese ep11_home_label_aa4b3882:

    # dad "When [name] was young, I found him in the attic looking through some boxes-"
    dad "[name]小时候，有次我撞见他在阁楼里翻箱子——"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2302
translate schinese ep11_home_label_40b48ca9:

    # mc "I know where you're going with this one, and I'll stop you right there."
    mc "我知道你想往哪儿引导我，现在就到此为止。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2304
translate schinese ep11_home_label_d231c244:

    # sa "What was in the boxes?"
    sa "箱子里有什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2306
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b8e545c7:

    # dad "Some of his mother's old clothes."
    dad "他妈妈以前的一些旧衣服。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2307
translate schinese ep11_home_label_62c520a8:

    # dad "When I found him up there, he put on a pair of stockings and sat down, stroking his legs."
    dad "当我找到他时，他穿上了一双丝袜，坐下来，一边摸着腿一边晃着脚。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2309
translate schinese ep11_home_label_6cc23e68:

    # sa "BAHAHA!"
    sa "哈哈哈！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2311
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a09a8cab:

    # mc "Dad! Stop it."
    mc "爸爸！别这样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2313
translate schinese ep11_home_label_9c1de515:

    # sa "So, your son is a crossdresser?"
    sa "所以你儿子是个跨性别者？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2315
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b986ae60:

    # dad "He said he put them on because he liked how they felt against his hand. He found them very soft."
    dad "他说他穿上是因为喜欢它们贴在手上的感觉。他觉得它们非常柔软。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2317
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a8c5cb02:

    # mc "This day was a big mistake."
    mc "这天真是个大错误。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2319
translate schinese ep11_home_label_07dfc9c6:

    # sa "So, that's why you love stockings?"
    sa "所以这就是你喜欢丝袜的原因？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2321
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b551ec12:

    # mc "No comment..."
    mc "没意见。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2323
translate schinese ep11_home_label_f9f5258e:

    # sa "Did he wear them a lot growing up?"
    sa "他小时候经常穿吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2325
translate schinese ep11_home_label_b28ad3bb:

    # dad "Haha, no, it was just the one time. But it's not easy to forget."
    dad "哈哈，不，就那次。但忘不了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2327
translate schinese ep11_home_label_4ac080f2:

    # mc "If you stop bringing it up, it will be easier."
    mc "如果你不一直提这件事，事情会好办些。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2329
translate schinese ep11_home_label_f6802289:

    # dad "Now I want to hear your story. Who is Sage?"
    dad "现在我想听听你的故事。Sage是谁？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2331
translate schinese ep11_home_label_6a844580:

    # sa "Oh? Um... Where do I begin?"
    sa "哦？嗯……我该从哪儿说起呢？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2334
translate schinese ep11_home_label_91b1122d:

    # "*{i}Phone rings{/i}*"
    "*{i}电话铃声响起{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2335
translate schinese ep11_home_label_56e810c6:

    # sa "Shoot... It's Jill. We've got plans tomorrow. Mind if I take this?"
    sa "哎呀，是Jill。我们明天有安排。我接一下行吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2337
translate schinese ep11_home_label_c70972c9:

    # dad "Go ahead, but don't try to get out of telling me that story."
    dad "你尽管接吧，但别想用这个借口躲开讲那个故事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2339
translate schinese ep11_home_label_97820127:

    # sa "I won't."
    sa "我不会。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2341
translate schinese ep11_home_label_12d1a06b:

    # sa "Jill! What's up!?"
    sa "Jill！咋了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2343
translate schinese ep11_home_label_76c4c361:

    # dad "I can see why you like her so much. She seems easy-going."
    dad "我能理解你为什么这么喜欢她。她看起来挺随和的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2345
translate schinese ep11_home_label_bf1615e1:

    # mc "You two are certainly hitting it off... But don't embarrass me like that. I like her a lot."
    mc "你们俩确实挺合得来的……但别这样让我难堪。我很喜欢她。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2347
translate schinese ep11_home_label_1f60e135:

    # dad "You worry too much. I'm not embarrassing you at all."
    dad "你太担心了。我可没让你丢脸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2349
translate schinese ep11_home_label_daf13cf6:

    # mc "You told her you had to knock on my door because you'd walk in on me doing stuff and that I used to wear stockings."
    mc "你跟她说你必须敲我门是因为你怕撞见我在做些事情，还说以前我经常穿丝袜。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2351
translate schinese ep11_home_label_8a2c67cd:

    # dad "Well, you did!"
    dad "好吧，你确实做到了！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2353
translate schinese ep11_home_label_fc745434:

    # mc "She doesn't need to know that."
    mc "她不需要知道这些。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2354
translate schinese ep11_home_label_23fe1ebc:

    # mc "Stop smiling."
    mc "别笑了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2356
translate schinese ep11_home_label_11837645:

    # dad "Haha! I've missed you."
    dad "哈哈！想死你了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2358
translate schinese ep11_home_label_74fc6761:

    # mc "Me too."
    mc "我也是。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2361
translate schinese ep11_home_label_e1187648:

    # ji "Thanks for dinner. You sure know how to cook."
    ji "谢谢晚餐。你真会做饭。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2363
translate schinese ep11_home_label_23deb7c5:

    # dad "You are too kind."
    dad "你太客气了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2365
translate schinese ep11_home_label_0297de8e:

    # mc "It was great. Thanks, Dad."
    mc "真棒。谢谢老爸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2367
translate schinese ep11_home_label_8b727abb:

    # ji "May I use the restroom?"
    ji "可以去洗手间吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2369
translate schinese ep11_home_label_a71ea66b:

    # mc "You remember where it is, yeah?"
    mc "你记得在哪吧，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2371
translate schinese ep11_home_label_5c02e142:

    # ji "Yes. The door from across your room."
    ji "对，就是你房间对面那扇门。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:2373
