translate schinese ep11_campus_label_87a6aaeb:

    # mc "No shit."
    mc "别他妈装了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3575
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_0acd8da6:

    # ta "Can you just listen to me?"
    ta "你能听我说完吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3577
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_ed87226f:

    # mc "What do you want?"
    mc "你想干什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3579
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_1a76a99b:

    # ta "I want to explain things."
    ta "我想解释一下。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3580
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_12353a11:

    # ta "I've tried talking to you guys, but no one wants to listen."
    ta "我试着跟你们说过，但没人想听。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3582
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_1c2e396f:

    # mc "After what you girls did, can you blame us?"
    mc "你们女孩做了那些事，我们不怪你们，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3584
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_24ed8c97:

    # ta "It wasn't me, ok?"
    ta "这事儿跟我没关系，好吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3586
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_72c97ee4:

    # mc "Did you know about it?"
    mc "你知道这件事吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3588
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_7336e19f:

    # ta "Well, yeah."
    ta "那当然。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3590
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_776332ed:

    # mc "Then you're part of the problem."
    mc "那你就是问题的一部分。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3592
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_e15ff17b:

    # ta "Wait!"
    ta "等等！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3593
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_8928bdbb:

    # ta "Just because some think one way doesn't mean we all agree."
    ta "只要有些人这么想，并不代表我们全都这么认为。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3596
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_e493e9f2:

    # mc "What the fuck are you yapping about?"
    mc "你他妈在说啥玩意儿？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3598
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_ef2d5d57:

    # mc "What are you getting at?"
    mc "你想说什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3600
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_3b2eeace:

    # ta "It wasn't my idea, ok?"
    ta "这事儿不是我提的，行了吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3601
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_cc3db805:

    # ta "Some of my friends feel you guys have treated them badly in the past. I didn't tell you about what they did because they're my friends."
    ta "一些我朋友觉得你们之前对他们不太好。我没跟你们说他们做了什么，因为他们是我的朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3602
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_f7600ba2:

    # ta "But I always thought they were overreacting."
    ta "但我一直觉得他们反应有点过了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3604
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_f0756f63:

    # ta "This whole thing was Avery's idea. She's the one who found the pictures on your wall on Halloween."
    ta "这整个主意都是Avery的。她就是那个在万圣节那天在你墙上找到那些照片的人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3605
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_81a8807f:

    # ta "I was against putting the posters up, but the rest of them wanted to do it."
    ta "我本来是反对贴那些海报的，但其他人非要坚持这么做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3607
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_9fefdb51:

    # ta "Kylie insisted on it."
    ta "Kylie坚持要这么做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3609
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_2f198fab:

    # mc "Kylie? Who the fuck is Kylie again?"
    mc "你问谁？那个Kylie是谁啊？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3611
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_2c28456f:

    # ta "Long hair. Large...um...breasts. She hangs out with Christie and Becky a lot."
    ta "长发。大...嗯...胸部。她经常和Christie、Becky待在一起。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3613
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_0cd5226d:

    # ta "She's on the right."
    ta "她站在右边。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3614
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_f9a25d8d:

    # mc "Oh, her? Why?"
    mc "哦，她？为什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3616
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_51f4e5ca:

    # ta "You guys treated her sister poorly in the past. She even dropped out of college because of it."
    ta "你们以前对她妹妹不好，她甚至因此退学了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3617
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_7eea2bc0:

    # ta "She had sex with this Vinny guy, and he locked her outside naked after they were done and made his friends chant as she tried to get her clothes back."
    ta "她和这个Vinny家伙发生了关系，做完之后他把她锁在门外光着身子，还让他的朋友朝她喊叫，她想拿回衣服都拿不着。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3619
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_62d31586:

    # ta "She had to run naked back to her dorm."
    ta "她不得不光着身子跑回宿舍。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3620
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_480c151e:

    # ta "And my friends have many more of those stories, too. You might think you're having fun, but they think you're assholes for doing that."
    ta "而且我朋友们还有更多这种故事。你们可能觉得玩得挺开心，但她们觉得你们这么做是混蛋。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3622
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_11dd07dd:

    # mc "Not every one of us has done that to you girls."
    mc "不是我们每个人都对你家姐妹做过那种事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3624
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_9a53cb58:

    # ta "Every time there's a party at your place, you guys do something to humiliate someone. That's not nice, you know?"
    ta "每次你们在你们家办聚会，都会有人被你们羞辱。这可不是什么好事情，你们知道吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3626
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_95704225:

    # mc "I never did anything like that. And you posted my picture all over campus, humiliating me. That makes you the bad ones."
    mc "我从来没干过那种事。你们把我的照片贴满校园，羞辱我，这才说明做错事的是你们。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3628
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_3ed59b4e:

    # ta "They're giving all of you a taste of your own medicine. They want all the DIKs to be punished."
    ta "他们这是让你们尝尝自己酿的苦酒。他们想让所有DIKs们都受到惩罚。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3630
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_01dc7c37:

    # mc "Do you think what the DIKs did is comparable to what you girls did? You tried to ruin our frat by posting those pictures all over campus."
    mc "你真觉得她们做的事和你们女生做的一样吗？你们用那些照片把我们的兄弟会搞砸，到处贴满海报。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3632
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_d4044493:

    # ta "That's how they see it. It's tit for tat."
    ta "这就是他们这么想的。这是以牙还牙。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3634
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_9fcda43b:

    # mc "And what about Cathy? What did she do to deserve what she got? She had to quit her job because of those posters and the bullying."
    mc "还有Cathy呢？她做了什么，凭什么遭到那种对待？因为那些海报和霸凌，她连工作都辞了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3635
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_7ea3edde:

    # mc "How did she humiliate any of you? Was she just collateral damage, or what?"
    mc "她怎么羞辱了你们？她只是个意外受害者，还是说你们根本不在乎？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3637
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_2d98be26:

    # ta "They just posted what you guys already did."
    ta "她们只是贴出了你们之前做过的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3639
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_11455b53:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3641
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_247e6687:

    # ta "You posted that cluck and bragged about it, remember?"
    ta "你当时还发了那张照片，还到处炫耀，还记得吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3643
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_f1a586d1:

    # mc "We don't know who posted it. We suspected you girls were involved in it somehow."
    mc "我们不知道是谁贴的，只是怀疑你们几个可能以某种方式参与了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3645
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_57a4abf0:

    # ta "Oh... But it wasn't them."
    ta "哦……但那不是她们干的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3646
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_6bd93cd1:

    # ta "Avery said putting those posters up on campus was fair game because you already humiliated Cathy on Rooster."
    ta "Avery说在校园里贴那些海报是合理的，因为你们已经在Rooster上让Cathy丢脸了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3647
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_eedf12f5:

    # ta "She knew you guys were to blame for it and didn't want it to slip by unpunished."
    ta "她知道你们几个是这事的主谋，不想让它就这么轻易过去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3649
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_a96e967f:

    # mc "(This doesn't look good for Nick...)"
    mc "（这事儿对Nick可不妙...）"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3650
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_6edbfc1a:

    # mc "Who the fuck is Avery!?"
    mc "谁他妈的是Avery!?"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3652
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_24aa9fab:

    # ta "Hold on."
    ta "等等。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3654
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_e9d7c2de:

    # ta "This is Avery. The scarecrow."
    ta "这是Avery。那个稻草人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3656
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_b2fca918:

    # mc "She's the cause of all this?"
    mc "她就是这一切的源头？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3657
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_74b6ecc3:

    # mc "Is that why she's coming to our parties? To find ways to screw us over?"
    mc "这就是她来我们聚会的原因吗？就是为了找机会整我们？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3659
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_9d749ca9:

    # ta "It's not just her; more girls are in on it."
    ta "这不只是她一个人，还有更多女孩参与其中。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3661
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_d7d57044:

    # mc "Why are you snitching on them like this? What do you even want?"
    mc "你为什么要出卖她们？你到底想要什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3663
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_3b54029d:

    # ta "As I said in the beginning, I'm not in on this, but they are my friends."
    ta "正如我一开始说的，我并不参与这事，但她们是我的朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3665
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_178aa86b:

    # mc "Some friend you are."
    mc "你算什么朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3667
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_ba245bc0:

    # ta "I'm a friend of you guys, too. I like the DIKs and your parties."
    ta "我也是你们的朋友，我喜欢你和你们的派对。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3668
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_2f24a4c8:

    # ta "I think we'd all get along if you guys apologized to my friends for what you did and stopped doing it to them."
    ta "我觉得如果你们能为做了的事向我的朋友道歉，并且不再对他们这么做，我们大家都能相处得来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3670
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_f06735cb:

    # mc "I have nothing to apologize for; you're the ones who owe me an apology."
    mc "我没什么好道歉的；该道歉的是你们。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3671
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_3044b0cf:

    # mc "And if what my brothers do bothers you so much, why the hell do you keep coming back to our parties?"
    mc "如果你觉得你兄弟们做的事让你这么烦，那你他妈还为什么老是来我们聚会？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3672
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_0bbe4cf9:

    # mc "I know those guys, and they didn't mean anything bad with what they did. They're just having fun together; it's a stupid brotherhood thing."
    mc "我知道那些家伙，他们没恶意，只是在一块玩得开心，这是兄弟会的傻事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3674
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_c8bde4b4:

    # ta "Yeah, so can you talk to them? And maybe get them to apologize?"
    ta "你能不能跟他们说说？让他们道个歉？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3676
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:3685
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_93b9bb7f:

    # mc "The fucking nerve on you..."
    mc "你们他妈的胆子也太大了..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:3686
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_2e588344:

    # mc "I should have left with Derek."
    mc "我本该和Derek一起走的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3694
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_fe9697e8:

    # mc "I'll tell them what you said, but it's not enough to forget what you girls did."
    mc "我会把你说的话告诉他们，但这远远不够让我忘记你们这些女人干了什么。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3695
translate schinese ep11_campus_label_08e48daa:

    # mc "Don't expect any apologies."
    mc "别指望会有什么道歉。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3710
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_cdc343c0:

    # ly "Don't tell me that bimbo was making moves on you."
    ly "别跟我说那个傻瓜在勾引你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3712
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_0d27c934:

    # mc "What? No, she wasn't."
    mc "什么？不，她没那么做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3714
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_fab2344a:

    # ly "Hm... She must have done something to you. You look annoyed. Want me to slap that bitch?"
    ly "嗯...她肯定对你做了什么。你看起来很烦。要我打她一巴掌吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3718
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_c6776ebe:

    # mc "Would you?"
    mc "要吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3720
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_4e769e6c:

    # ly "Say the word and I'll make a fist before the slap."
    ly "说句话，我立马就扇她耳光。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3722
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_00a422de:

    # mc "Well, that's good to know."
    mc "那就好。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3724
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_e284e5b6:

    # mc "Don't bother. She's not worth it."
    mc "别费劲了。她不值得。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3726
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_80bc3542:

    # ly "Clearly."
    ly "显然。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3728
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_8d33b596:

    # ly "Talk to me. What's got you upset?"
    ly "跟我说说，什么事让你这么烦？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3730
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_52a735ae:

    # mc "At the moment...a lot."
    mc "此刻……好多事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3732
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_c59acf99:

    # ly "Wanna be alone?"
    ly "想一个人待着？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3734
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_e223a4c1:

    # mc "No, I could use a distraction."
    mc "不，我正需要个分心的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3736
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_f88a872e:

    # ly "I excel at distractions. Just grab my ass and you'll forget about your troubles."
    ly "我最擅长转移注意力了。只要你抓着我的屁股，保证你那些烦心事立马就忘掉。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3738
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_fd6338ea:

    # mc "I wish."
    mc "我真希望。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3740
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_03a33e8b:

    # ly "Seriously. Grab it."
    ly "认真点。抓起来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3742
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_6651ab87:

    # mc "Alright."
    mc "嗯。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3744
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_95795386:

    # mc "That does feel better."
    mc "感觉好多了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3746
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_67817808:

    # ly "Magical, isn't it?"
    ly "真神奇，不是吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3747
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_883b071b:

    # ly "Whenever you feel like sharing what's up, let me know."
    ly "随时告诉我你有什么想说的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3749
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_66783818:

    # mc "What happened to keeping things shallow?"
    mc "怎么突然变得这么深沉了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3751
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_76f069f4:

    # ly "I was thinking about what you said at the jetty."
    ly "我在想你刚才在码头说的那些话。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3752
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_9174cf9e:

    # ly "Perhaps it's ok to share things about ourselves to some degree."
    ly "或许适当分享一些自己的事也没关系。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3753
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_f17b71a5:

    # ly "If we're not, we're gonna run out of conversation pretty damned fast, yeah?"
    ly "如果我们不继续聊下去，很快就会没什么好说的了，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3755
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_52c9068b:

    # mc "I'm happy you came around, but I don't feel like talking about the DIKs now."
    mc "我很高兴你终于想通了，但现在不想提那件事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3757
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_92158331:

    # ly "Trouble in paradise?"
    ly "天堂也有麻烦吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3759
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_5ba8d0df:

    # mc "Paradise? Try hell."
    mc "天堂？试试地狱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3761
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_f38607c8:

    # ly "Sounds serious."
    ly "听起来挺严重的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3763
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_a16db31d:

    # mc "It is."
    mc "是的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3765
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_72eaaa17:

    # ly "*{i}Smack{/i}*"
    ly "*{i}一巴掌{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3767
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_caf1b1d7:

    # ly "Don't make a big deal out of it. You looked like you could use it."
    ly "别把这事说得那么严重。你看起来像是需要点刺激。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3769
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_8e140b8f:

    # mc "You better stop that. You almost make me think you care about me."
    mc "你最好别这样。你差点让我以为你在意我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3775
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_53f6c155:

    # ly "Sup, Quinn!"
    ly "嘿，Quinn！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3777
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_3aeb3311:

    # ly "She's clearly not a morning person."
    ly "她明显不是早起的人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3782
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_69c25b65:

    # mc "Yeah..."
    mc "嗯..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:3786
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_d436b356:

    # mc "I'm gonna talk to her."
    mc "我要跟她谈谈。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3788
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_94e55659:

    # ly "Huh? Now?"
    ly "嗯？现在？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3790
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_de9f96f9:

    # mc "Yeah? Is that a problem?"
    mc "你是认真的吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3792
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_e4aee5f1:

    # ly "Your hand is still on my ass, and you're gonna chase another girl down the hall."
    ly "你手还在我的屁股上，还想去追别的女孩？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3794
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_3829b045:

    # mc "That's a yes, right?"
    mc "那就是个肯定的回答，对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:3796
translate schinese ep11_lily_campus_label_fe3b4c90:

