    # ch "If you don't know, you don't need to know."
    ch "如果你不知道，你就不需要知道。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5031
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_6fbc1117:

    # mc "I do because I'm also trying to find out who sent it. Someone is dragging me and my frat in the mud and causing stupid fights between you guys and us, and even among ourselves."
    mc "我也是在查是谁寄的。有人在拖我们和兄弟会下水，搞得你们和我们之间闹得不可开交，甚至你们自己人之间也打起来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5032
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_c466169d:

    # mc "It even got you kicked out of the tri-alphas! Don't you see how much damage it has caused?"
    mc "它甚至把你踢出了三阿尔法兄弟会！你没看到这造成了多大的伤害吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5034
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_8c98cbae:

    # ch "There were pictures of DIKs banging Arieth. You guys aren't innocent."
    ch "有张照片是DIKs们和Arieth在搞事情。你们也不是什么清白的人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5036
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_b63841bb:

    # mc "I'm not gonna lie and say those pictures don't exist because I know they do."
    mc "我可没撒谎说那些照片不存在，我知道它们确实存在。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5037
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_2c7dd9c3:

    # mc "But no one is admitting to sending them to you to provoke, and it sure as hell wasn't me."
    mc "但没人承认是发给你的，用来挑事的，而且他妈的肯定不是我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5039
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_5491d601:

    # mc "What was the threat?"
    mc "那威胁是什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5041
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_fd6a1c7d:

    # ch "Your five minutes are up."
    ch "你的时间到五分钟了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5043
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_5a04a7a5:

    # mc "Was it about you and Troy?"
    mc "这是关于你和Troy的事吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5046
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_c79feafb:

    # ch "It was you."
    ch "是你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5048
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_e51599dc:

    # mc "No. I found that one out way later."
    mc "不，我后来才搞清楚的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5049
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_7e901d53:

    # mc "You should be more careful in the gym locker room; I walked in on you two kissing."
    mc "你在健身房更衣室应该更小心点；我撞见你俩在亲热。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5051
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_66639a52:

    # ch "Who have you told?"
    ch "你跟谁说的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5053
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_2ef573c6:

    # mc "I haven't told anyone about it."
    mc "我没告诉任何人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5055
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_7a180453:

    # ch "Liar!"
    ch "骗子！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5058
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_bfd2fa17:

    # mc "I'm not lying. The moment I saw it, I realized a lot about you."
    mc "我没在说谎。我一看到那件事，就明白了很多关于你的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5064
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_533aba92:

    # mc "I told one friend of mine, and I know I can trust her not to tell anyone."
    mc "我只告诉了一个朋友，我知道她不会把这件事说出去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5065
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_9b8e5451:

    # mc "And...I had to let Sage know."
    mc "而且……我不得不把这事告诉Sage。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5067
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_75fdf436:

    # mc "I had to let Sage know..."
    mc "我必须让Sage知道……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5071
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_796cb551:

    # ch "Sage knows?"
    ch "Sage知道了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5073
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_c7852e60:

    # mc "And has known for quite a while."
    mc "而且早就知道了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5077
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_a44ae21b:

    # ch "I had a feeling she knew something... So, that's why?"
    ch "我有种感觉，她早就知道些什么……所以，这就是为什么吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5078
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_142930cc:

    # ch "She didn't tell me she knew... Why?"
    ch "她没告诉我她早就知道了……为什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5080
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_c37da1ba:

    # mc "You hurt her a lot, breaking up with her like you did. You made her believe she did something wrong."
    mc "你跟她分手的方式伤她很深，你让她以为是她自己做错了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5081
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_3ac8978d:

    # mc "I told her because you refused to do it. She needed to hear it to move on."
    mc "我告诉她是因为你不愿意做。她需要听到真相才能继续往前走。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5082
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_bcbd9b0d:

    # mc "And you didn't have the balls to be honest with her."
    mc "你连跟她坦白的勇气都没有。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5086
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_a7576e1d:

    # mc "And for her not to hold it against you or throw it in your face, that's the Sage I know."
    mc "而且她没因此记恨你或者当面戳你，这就是我认识的Sage。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5087
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_20865a61:

    # mc "She's worth more than the way you treated her."
    mc "她值得比你对她那副德行更多。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5089
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_b98af854:

    # ch "You're acting like I had a choice!"
    ch "你以为我有选择？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5091
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_821c5fda:

    # mc "Of course, you had a choice. You chose to be with Sage and to cheat on her."
    mc "当然你有选择，你选择和Sage在一起，还背叛了她。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5093
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_ee032f24:

    # ch "You don't know what you're getting yourself into."
    ch "你根本不知道自己在蹚什么浑水。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5094
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_a420f5d2:

    # ch "If you think this ends with Sage or who the hell is sending those letters, you're dead wrong."
    ch "如果你以为这事儿就到Sage或者那个到底是谁在寄信的人就完了，那你真是想得太简单了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5096
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_b2b9e19d:

    # mc "What do you mean?"
    mc "你这话是什么意思？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5098
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_357f00d5:

    # ch "You have no idea. Let it go. Just let all of it go."
    ch "你根本不知道。别管了，就让一切都过去吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5100
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_69844a2b:

    # mc "I can't do that. It's not just about you. I'm in this mess, too."
    mc "我不能就这样放手。这不只是你的事，我也是被卷进来了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5102
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_533aba92_1:

    # mc "I told one friend of mine, and I know I can trust her not to tell anyone."
    mc "我只告诉了一个朋友，我知道她不会把这事说出去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5107
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_9058ae3a:

    # mc "Let me say that I get why you need to hide this from your friends. I would too, if the jocks were my friends."
    mc "我能理解你为什么需要瞒着朋友这件事。如果那些混混是我的朋友，我也会这么做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5109
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_e240062f:

    # ch "What will I have to do to keep you from telling them?"
    ch "我得做些什么才能让你别告诉他们？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5112
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_bd0b28ef:

    # mc "I meant it when I said blackmailing is for pussies. I'm not using this against you."
    mc "我说这话是认真的，勒索是给胆小鬼看的。我这不是拿这个来对付你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5114
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_121e3c0c:

    # mc "Nothing. I didn't bring it up to use it against you."
    mc "没什么。我提起这事不是想拿你怎么样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5115
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_ad951f3a:

    # mc "I brought it up because I had a hunch that it was involved, and it turned out I was right."
    mc "我提起这事是因为我猜它跟这事有关，结果我猜对了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5116
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_a3864698:

    # mc "All I want is to find out who's fucking us over - you and me both."
    mc "我只想知道是谁在坑我们——你和我一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5118
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_f339c265:

    # ch "I received two letters, ok? One was addressed to Dawe, and the other had my name written on it."
    ch "我收到了两封信，明白吗？一封是寄给Dawe的，另一封上面写着我的名字。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5119
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_df9afc7b:

    # ch "Dawe's letter had pictures of DIKs banging Arieth."
    ch "Dawe的信里有DIKs们和Arieth搞在一起的照片。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5121
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_0572ca0d:

    # ch "And it's not like that's any news. She's the rusty town bike that everyone rides."
    ch "而且这也不是什么新鲜事。她就是镇上那个所有人都骑的自行车。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5122
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_4a9d2b74:

    # ch "Dawe gets all naive and dismissive about her doing that behind his back. But he couldn't dodge this one."
    ch "Dawe突然变得天真又轻描淡写，好像她背后搞这些事是理所当然的。但他这次没那么容易躲过去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5124
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_370d7ce8:

    # mc "What about your letter?"
    mc "你那封信呢？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5126
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_36eec3a6:

    # ch "It was a veiled threat saying, \"Is this what you're hiding?\"."
    ch "那是一句隐晦的威胁，意思就是：“你藏起来的是这个吗？”"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5127
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_179410bc:

    # ch "And it included a picture of me with...you know... Again, in the locker room."
    ch "而且里面还有一张我跟你……你懂的……再次在更衣室里的照片。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5129
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_fdf02a0f:

    # ch "Dawe caught you sneaking around in there while I was talking to Troy on the phone."
    ch "Dawe 你偷摸摸在我跟Troy打电话的时候溜进更衣室，被我抓个正着。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5130
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_41d4dbcd:

    # ch "That's why I thought you sent it. I figured you overheard and knew all about it and even took that photo of us."
    ch "这就是我以为是你寄的信的原因。我猜你听到一切，知道内情，甚至拍了我们那张照片。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5131
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_bbb344db:

    # ch "And since I treated you like shit for talking to Sage, it was your revenge."
    ch "而且因为我对你说话那么刻薄，因为你跟Sage说话，这算是你的报复吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5132
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_8493e7df:

    # ch "The content of Dawe's letter reinforced my suspicions that it was related to you and the DIKs."
    ch "信件内容进一步加深了我的怀疑，觉得这件事和你还有DIKs们有关。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5134
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_ac5a30b0:

    # mc "I heard the phone call, yeah. But I thought it was another girl you were talking to."
    mc "我听到了电话那头的声音，没错。但我以为你是在跟另一个女孩说话。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5135
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_c3e5fe55:

    # mc "You're not completely wrong, after all."
    mc "你也不是完全错啦。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5137
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_8c6de57b:

    # ch "Anyway... That's all I know."
    ch "反正……这就是我所知道的全部了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5139
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_e06a427b:

    # mc "It helped clear some things out, for sure..."
    mc "这确实帮我省了不少心，肯定的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5140
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_c0b3add4:

    # mc "But who the hell sent those letters, and what do they gain from blackmailing you?"
    mc "但到底是谁寄的那些信，他们又图什么，非要拿你来要挟？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5142
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_27921ba8:

    # ch "It beats me. And I'm fucking worried... Someone else knows, and from the looks of it, they aren't afraid to use that against me."
    ch "这我可说不上来。而且我他妈还很担心……还有别的人知道这件事，而且看起来他们一点都不介意拿这个来对付我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5143
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_f951f589:

    # ch "All this time, the thought that it was you kept me cool because it felt like we had a non-verbal understanding."
    ch "这一段时间，我一直在想是你，才让我能保持冷静，因为感觉我们之间有种心照不宣的默契。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5144
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_cba96cc5:

    # ch "And now I know it was all in my head..."
    ch "现在我知道，一切都是我脑子里的念头……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5145
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_71c2f22d:

    # ch "My best bet is that it's someone in your frat. Who else would have those pictures of Arieth other than you guys?"
    ch "我猜最有可能的是你兄弟会里的人。除了你们，还有谁会有Arieth的照片？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5147
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_54914bb8:

    # mc "It could be, yeah. Those pictures exist on our laptop, and everything seems to point to that laptop - except for that picture you got. It's the first time I've heard of it."
    mc "可能是吧。那些照片确实在我们笔记本电脑里，一切迹象都指向那台电脑——除了你那张照片。那是我第一次听说这张照片。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5148
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_42c1ac4e:

    # mc "But I'm not completely sure one of us has been sending those letters."
    mc "但我确定不了是不是我们其中有人在寄那些信。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5149
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_09aa493f:

    # mc "Did you see or hear about someone from your frat talking to one of us in private?"
    mc "你听说你们兄弟会有人私下跟我们其中一个谈过吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5151
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_2fd0ca07:

    # ch "We hate you guys. There's not a chance in hell that would ever happen."
    ch "我们恨你们这群人。这种事根本不可能发生。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5152
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_94890674:

    # ch "Well...this is one hell of an exception."
    ch "这算是个特例了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5153
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_56c7c858:

    # ch "I can't vouch for you with my brothers and say you didn't send those letters."
    ch "我没法向兄弟们担保你没寄那些信。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5155
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_94bf2b7f:

    # mc "I get why, but that's not what I'm concerned about."
    mc "我明白你的意思，但那不是我担心的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5156
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_524588db:

    # mc "Telling your friends anything about our talk would make them ask questions you couldn't answer. I understand that."
    mc "告诉你的朋友我们谈过什么，他们会问一些你答不上来的问题。我明白你的意思。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5157
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_cb0d7fd0:

    # mc "And I can't clear my name either...because you'd deny it. I could try telling my brothers, but we have somewhat of a trust issue going on..."
    mc "而且我也没法洗清自己的名声……因为你会否认的。我本可以试着告诉我的兄弟们，但我们之间有点信任问题……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5159
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_cada2391:

    # ch "If it helps you clear it up with them, I'd settle for calling it a misunderstanding, but that I still blame them."
    ch "如果这能帮你跟他们解释清楚，我愿意称之为误会，但那锅还是得他们来背。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5161
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_50e1a06e:

    # mc "I'm cool with that."
    mc "我接受这个说法。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5163
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_441c0765:

    # ch "Anything else?"
    ch "还有别的吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5165
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_3c74febf:

    # mc "Yes... This might be a long shot, but do you know why you guys didn't trash Nick's room when our mansion got wrecked?"
    mc "是啊……这可能是个很牵强的猜测，但你知道为什么你们当时没砸Nick的房间吗？我们家那场骚乱的时候。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5167
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_0598f082:

    # ch "I had nothing to do with that. I don't care and I wouldn't know."
    ch "我没参与那件事。我根本不在乎，也不清楚内情。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5169
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_a827b39e:

    # mc "Can you find out? It might be a clue that you and I need."
    mc "你能查查吗？这可能是个线索，对我们俩都很重要。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5171
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_8d65dd91:

    # ch "*{i}Sigh{/i}* I'll look into it. Let me know if you figure shit out."
    ch "*{i}叹气{/i}* 我会查查看。你要是弄清楚了什么，就告诉我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5173
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_87957c89:

    # mc "You too. Thanks for hearing me out."
    mc "你也是。谢谢听我说这些。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5179
translate schinese ep11_chad_label_ebefcccc:

    # mc "(Fuck... I got some answers, but this was kind of a dead end...)"
    mc "（操... 我搞到了一些答案，但这条路算是走死了...）"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5188
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_9ffbd01e:

    # li "You can't be serious!"
    li "你不可能是认真的！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5190
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_54045469:

    # no "I have made myself perfectly clear on this. Eating in the lab is strictly forbidden."
    no "我刚才已经说得非常清楚了，实验室里吃饭是绝对禁止的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5191
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_514f357e:

    # no "I've warned you once before and now you leave me with no choice."
    no "我之前已经警告过你一次了，现在我只能这么做了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5193
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_571f1f3d:

    # li "I have problems with my blood sugar! You're discriminating against my human rights."
    li "我血糖有问题！你这是在侵犯我的人权！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5195
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_09995b4b:

    # no "You can take it up with the disciplinary committee. I won't have anyone in the lab who's jeopardizing their safety or that of others."
    no "你可以去找纪律委员会说说。我不会让任何人在这个实验室里危及自己的安全或他人的安全。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5196
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_0da90bfd:

    # no "I am responsible for you when you are in class, and you have shown a blatant disregard by breaking the established rules."
    no "我负责你在课堂上的安全，而你却明目张胆地违反规定，这已经不是第一次了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5198
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_a4e7ec9d:

    # li "For fuck's sake! It's just a bacon cheeseburger! I'm not drinking any chemicals!"
    li "操，这他妈只是个培根奶酪汉堡！我可没喝什么化学药剂！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5199
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_ae61c526:

    # li "Show me a chemical or beaker that I could have mistaken for this burger."
    li "拿一种可能让我误认为这个汉堡的化学试剂或烧杯给我看看。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5201
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_24b01154:

    # no "Surfaces where you put your food could be contaminated, and then you'd ingest the potentially hazardous contaminants."
    no "表面放食物的地方可能被污染，然后你就会摄入潜在的有害物质。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:5203
translate schinese ep11_lab_label_c56c888c:

    # li "But I didn't put down the burger anywhere. I've had it in my pocket and hands this whole time."
