# episode11\update11.rpy:6253
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_ba42f342:

    # my "Thank you. It's a surreal feeling..."
    my "谢谢。感觉很不真实……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6254
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_f6316a9e:

    # my "But I'm not completely out of the woods yet. There's still one matter that remains."
    my "但我还没完全脱险。还有一件事没解决。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6256
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_a5aa52e3:

    # sa "Talking to your dad?"
    sa "跟你爸谈过了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6258
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_22b573ce:

    # my "He will realize something is wrong when it's time to pay my tuition."
    my "他会在该付学费的时候发现事情不对劲。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6260
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_abe9f1f3:

    # sa "Are you nervous?"
    sa "你紧张吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6262
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_c4bd690c:

    # my "I thought I'd be nervous. I should be nervous. But I'm not."
    my "我以为我会紧张。我应该紧张。但我不紧张。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6264
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_5b4b76ac:

    # sa "How will you do it?"
    sa "你怎么打算做到？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6266
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_97bb474a:

    # my "I will tell him how it is. That I've decided to fund college independently in a way that doesn't involve him."
    my "我会告诉他真相。我已经决定以不牵涉他的方式自己负担大学费用。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6267
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_89ca7321:

    # my "I will thank him for lending me the money for one semester and that I won't need his money from now on."
    my "我会感谢他这学期借我钱的恩情，并告诉他以后再也不用他出钱了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6269
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_10794acd:

    # my "At this point, he'll probably get mad. And that's why Derek will be there with me to help defuse the situation."
    my "这时候他大概会生气。这也是为什么Derek会在我身边帮我缓和一下局面。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6270
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_8c468033:

    # my "And I will tell Dad that I'll pay him back what I owe him and that he will have to decide."
    my "我会告诉爸爸我打算还清欠他的钱，然后让他自己决定。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6272
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_168421ab:

    # sa "Decide on what?"
    sa "决定什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6274
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_2658ee85:

    # my "If he can ever be ok with having a daughter who is gay or not."
    my "如果他能接受有个女儿是同性恋或者不是。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6275
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_8bc82b05:

    # my "And if he can't... I will tell him that the day Mom passes away is the last day I pretend to be his daughter."
    my "如果他不能接受……我会告诉他，妈妈去世的那天，就是我最后一次假装他是我父亲的那一天。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6276
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_563f1070:

    # my "And that every day until that day, I'll do it for Mom - not for him."
    my "而且从那天起，我每天都会这么做，是为了妈妈——而不是为了他。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6278
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_0c02d09c:

    # sa "You're going to say that to him?"
    sa "你真打算跟他说这些？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6280
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_1208af0f:

    # my "Believe me when I say I've had these thoughts for a long time."
    my "相信我，我早就这么想了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6281
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_34192f49:

    # my "I want to give him a final chance on my terms. And if he can't accept that, I won't accept him as my dad."
    my "我想按自己的方式给他最后一次机会。如果他接受不了，那我也不再接受他当我的爸爸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6294
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_772a0569:

    # my "*{i}Sigh{/i}* This is supposed to feel like a victory... Yet it feels like a loss."
    my "*{i}叹气{/i}* 这本该像是一场胜利……可感觉却像输了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6296
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_8ff2b70a:

    # sa "If it is a loss, it's his loss, not yours. You need to understand that."
    sa "如果这是损失，那也是他的损失，跟你无关。你得明白这一点。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6300
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_a238199d:

    # sa "Grab some Christmas lights from that box. Help us decorate and get some Christmas spirit."
    sa "从那个盒子里拿些圣诞灯来，帮我们装饰一下，找回点圣诞气氛。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6301
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_61b379ae:

    # sa "Maybe you'll cheer up."
    sa "也许你会好点。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6306
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_d1859898:

    # sa "I understand..."
    sa "我明白..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6308
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_d2e53228:

    # my "But I don't think Josy will ever understand it. And I've tried to explain it to her several times now."
    my "但我觉得Josy永远都不会理解。我已经跟她解释过好几次了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6310
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_e82d267b:

    # sa "You have to give her time. It's still a fresh wound."
    sa "你得给她时间。这伤口还很新鲜。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6312
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_247a3d8b:

    # my "More like a wound that had begun to heal, only to be slit open again."
    my "更像是一个开始愈合的伤口，又被重新割开。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6313
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_97efc9d2:

    # my "Only that this time... We're not fighting about it."
    my "只有这次……我们不是在为这事争吵。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6315
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_d379670e:

    # sa "Well, that's something."
    sa "那倒是件事儿。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6317
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_9c15d1a5:

    # my "No. You don't understand."
    my "你根本不懂。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6318
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_311be8dc:

    # my "When Josy and I fight, we sometimes say mean things to each other that we don't mean, and it can get pretty heated."
    my "当我和Josy吵架的时候，我们有时候会互相说一些伤人的话，其实心里并不真那么想，气氛也会变得很紧张。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6319
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_9cd7cd1c:

    # my "But we've always fought for the same thing in different ways."
    my "但我们一直以来都是为了同样的事情，只是用不同的方式去争。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6321
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_bf3f1936:

    # my "And now... We're not fighting anymore."
    my "现在……我们不再打架了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6322
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_126e882c:

    # my "We're not getting upset or yelling."
    my "我们也不再激动或者大喊大叫了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6323
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_84ee657b:

    # my "And we talk way less about it."
    my "而且我们很少再提起这件事了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6325
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_eccfe0ae:

    # sa "And you don't think that's good? Do you want to fight with her?"
    sa "你就不觉得这样很好吗？你想和她打架吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6327
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_24e469ed:

    # my "Of course, I don't want to fight with her. Who in their right mind wants to fight? Fighting is horrible."
    my "当然，我不想和她打架。谁会想打架啊？打架真是糟心的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6328
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_114ed0bf:

    # my "But I have this bad feeling growing inside of me."
    my "但我心里有种不好的预感在慢慢滋生。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6330
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_58fb1615:

    # my "Like, we're supposed to fight, but we don't."
    my "比如，我们本该打架，但我们没打。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6331
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_3506aebe:

    # my "If you're not fighting for something...have you given up?"
    my "如果你不是为了什么在战斗……那你是不是已经放弃了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6333
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_c270a223:

    # sa "Is that how you look at your choice with Patrick? Have you given up or chosen to adapt because you've run out of options?"
    sa "这是你对Patrick的选择看法吗？你是放弃了，还是因为没得选才选择适应的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6335
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_e67228f6:

    # my "No, I'm adapting for sure."
    my "不，我肯定是在适应。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6337
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_9b2d23d2:

    # sa "Then, there you have it. Maybe she's adapting too?"
    sa "那你就明白了。也许她也在适应？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6339
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_1275e0c9:

    # my "I guess I'm worried...that's all."
    my "我想我就是担心……就这些。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6341
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_6b5cd97f:

    # sa "Wait. Are you worried about her feelings or yours?"
    sa "等等。你是担心她的心情，还是自己的感受？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6343
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_fc645303:

    # my "..."
    my "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6345
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_77648815:

    # my "It's complicated."
    my "这情况挺复杂的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6348
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_1385333d:

    # sa "No shit, it's complicated. There are three of you in that relationship."
    sa "别说啦，这情况确实复杂。你们三个在那段关系里。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6350
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_42d9d285:

    # my "Maybe that's why we're not fighting."
    my "也许这就是为什么我们没吵起来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6352
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_f735fdf0:

    # sa "Huh? Because of [name]?"
    sa "因为什么？[name]?"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6354
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_fc645303_1:

    # my "..."
    my "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6356
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_23f1ec93:

    # my "I don't know what I'm saying. I'm talking out loud without thinking."
    my "我不知道自己在说什么，我是在没想清楚的时候就说了出来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6358
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_c09c06d6:

    # sa "You can't control Josy's feelings, but you can be in charge of your own emotions."
    sa "你管不着Josy的感觉，但你能控制好自己的情绪。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6359
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_76b0f5e4:

    # sa "It's good that you're talking about this to me, but honestly, you're not talking to the person you should be having this conversation with."
    sa "跟你谈这些我很高兴，但说实话，你该跟的人不是我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6361
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_5b3102f3:

    # my "You're right. And that's what I'm saying... But you're the one I felt like I could talk to."
    my "你说得对。这就是我想说的……但你是我感觉能跟我说这些的人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6374
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_cc5200c9:

    # sa "Things will work out fine, Maya - one way or the other."
    sa "一切都会好起来的，Maya——不管怎样都会。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6375
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_5e42733a:

    # sa "You have friends and support. Don't forget that."
    sa "你有朋友和依靠，别忘了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6379
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_9f9da5ff:

    # sa "Grab some Christmas lights from that box. Help us decorate and get lost in your thoughts while doing it."
    sa "从那个盒子里拿些圣诞灯带，帮我们布置一下。一边装饰一边让你的思绪飘远。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6380
translate schinese ep11_maya_label_42fcf92a:

    # sa "Maybe you'll find some answers there."
    sa "也许你能在那儿找到一些答案。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6387
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_6adb96ab:

    # sy "I'm here. Let's get over and done with this crap."
    sy "我来了。赶紧把这破事解决掉吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6389
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_3bd5ef41:

    # mc "Oh, yeah... I forgot about the time. I'm in the middle of planning a party here."
    mc "哦，对了……我忘了时间了。我现在正忙着筹备一个派对呢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6391
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_faaa8bb5:

    # sy "I'm not rescheduling. You'll have to postpone that."
    sy "我不会改时间。你得先推迟那件事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6393
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_a63cfd40:

    # mc "Sure, um... Let's sit on my bed. This place is somewhat of an organized mess at the moment."
    mc "好，嗯……我们坐我床上吧。这地方现在有点乱中有序。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6395
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_12040796:

    # sy "This better not take all evening."
    sy "这可别耽误整个晚上。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6397
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_0e72b349:

    # mc "It won't. I already wrote parts of it."
    mc "不会。我已经有部分内容写好了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6399
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_80b7cd0e:

    # sy "You did?"
    sy "你真的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6401
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_9badc9ca:

    # mc "You don't mind, do you?"
    mc "你介意吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6403
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_a46623fd:

    # sy "No, that's great. That saves me the trouble."
    sy "不，这样很好。这省了我不少麻烦。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6404
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_c9e84e3c:

    # sy "Did you write the theory...?"
    sy "你写的是理论部分？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6406
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_e0e6b99a:

    # mc "Yeah, I got the feeling you wanted me to."
    mc "对，我感觉你是想让我这么做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6407
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_9d9ad446:

    # mc "Look... I know you're struggling in class, and I'm not gonna be a dick about it."
    mc "看吧，我知道你上课挺吃力的，但我不会拿你开玩笑。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6409
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_8755d8c5:

    # sy "I'm not struggling!"
    sy "我可没在挣扎！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6411
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_ce005c8e:

    # mc "You are. You were all over the place in the lab and didn't know what the hell you were doing. But it's fine."
    mc "你就是。你在实验室里到处乱跑，根本不知道自己在干什么。不过没关系。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6413
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_64d087b8:

    # sy "You ARE a dick."
    sy "你他妈就是个混蛋。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6415
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_47f6778e:

    # mc "You don't have to feel ashamed. I think some stuff is hard, too."
    mc "你不用觉得丢脸。我觉得有些事也不太容易。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6417
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_1164f9a1:

    # sy "Speak for yourself. I'm doing fine in school."
    sy "管好你自己。我在学校表现挺好的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6419
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_24794c96:

    # mc "Alright. I was gonna offer you extra help if you needed it. That's all."
    mc "好。我本来是想如果你需要的话提供额外帮助。就这么简单。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6421
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_5c2c7bcf:

    # sy "..."
    sy "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6423
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_22723de4:

    # mc "But I'm guessing you have all the help you need from your friends. With the notes and old tests."
    mc "但我想你肯定已经从朋友那儿得到了足够的帮助，那些笔记和旧试卷应该都拿手了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6425
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_ff748f3f:

    # sy "Ugh, well, I would have if they weren't being assholes to me right now."
    sy "唉，要不是他们现在对我这么不爽，我早就不装了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6427
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_19c0ac93:

    # mc "Who's being an asshole?"
    mc "谁在装逼？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6429
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_4108ccd1:

    # sy "Ron, Magnar, Bert... Everyone!"
    sy "Ron、Magnar、Bert……所有人！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6430
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_4afc05ea:

    # sy "They're not sharing anything with me anymore."
    sy "他们现在都不跟我分享东西了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6432
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_8add343b:

    # mc "Why not? Did something happen?"
    mc "为啥不呢？发生什么事了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6434
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_d35a55d7:

    # sy "Mind your business."
    sy "管好你自己的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6436
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_6651c8a6:

    # mc "If you're gonna be like this about it, forget I asked."
    mc "如果你要这样对我，那我就不问了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6438
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_5c2c7bcf_1:

    # sy "..."
    sy "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6440
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_b82ce577:

    # sy "Hypothetically... What help are you offering?"
    sy "假设的话……你打算怎么帮我？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6442
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_2e2c2bb0:

    # mc "You could ask me about what you don't understand, and I could tell you what I know."
    mc "你可以问我你不懂的地方，我也可以告诉你我知道的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6443
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_00a7a196:

    # mc "Maybe I don't understand it either, but I could teach you if I do. And vice versa."
    mc "也许我也不太懂，但如果我懂的话，我也可以教你。反过来也一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6445
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_ff59dc02:

    # mc "Sometimes, when they teach us new things in class, I don't want to ask what they mean because I fear I'd look dumb."
    mc "有时候，老师在课堂上教我们新东西的时候，我不太想问那些词的意思，因为我怕看起来很蠢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6446
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_05d8c695:

    # mc "So, instead, I don't ask questions and have to learn on my own. Maybe you are the same way."
    mc "所以，我干脆就不问问题，只能自己慢慢学。也许你也是这样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6448
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_91ecfd04:

    # sy "Sometimes. Not a lot. But you know...?"
    sy "有时候。不多。但你知道吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6449
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_f52d94ad:

    # sy "It happens."
    sy "这就发生了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6451
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_008c1f00:

    # sy "Like, freaking Professor Willcock's lectures... They are impossible."
    sy "比如威尔科克教授那些烦死人的课……根本学不会。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6453
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_b24f2fde:

    # mc "Haha! I know, right? He wanted us to interrupt him and ask questions, but I couldn't even come up with a question about what he was talking about."
    mc "哈哈！我懂吧？他让我们打断他提问，但我连他讲什么都没搞懂，根本想不出该问什么问题。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6455
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_674918fa:

    # sy "Right? What am I supposed to ask?"
    sy "对吧？我该问什么啊？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6456
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_f700e421:

    # sy "\"Professor Willcock? What the hell are you talking about!?\""
    sy "“威尔科克教授？你到底在说什么啊！？”"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6458
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_b7013b93:

    # mc "Yeah, you can't ask that. Haha!"
    mc "对，你不能这么问。哈哈！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6460
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_e91216f4:

    # sy "So, you have no clue either?"
    sy "所以你也没头绪对吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6462
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_dc1ba08b:

    # mc "Some clue. But only because I read a lot after class."
    mc "有些线索。不过那只是因为我下课后读了很多书。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6464
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_fcd40506:

    # sy "I don't even understand when I do that."
    sy "我连自己在干嘛都不明白。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6466
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_c80914f9:

    # mc "How about we study together sometime? If we're gonna be lab partners from now on, we might as well, right?"
    mc "那我们找个时间一起学习吧？既然以后要当实验室搭档，那干脆一起努力，不是吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6468
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_513ae776:

    # sy "Maybe."
    sy "也许吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6471
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_1fed1bea:

    # mc "But we should write the report today. I think I figured out where we went wrong during lab."
    mc "但我们现在应该写报告了。我想我弄明白了我们在实验中哪里出错了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6473
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_aa0be3ce:

    # sy "Show me."
    sy "给我看看。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6475
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_00f29513:

    # mc "But we should write the report today."
    mc "但我们现在就写报告吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6477
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_ff7a657c:

    # sy "Right. Show me what you wrote."
    sy "好，给我看看你写的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6483
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_e2991656:

    # mc "Then multiply that with the molar mass..."
    mc "然后乘以摩尔质量..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6485
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_3373ad04:

    # sy "Done."
    sy "搞定。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6487
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_3f0b0a48:

    # mc "And divide that with the theoretical mass."
    mc "然后除以理论质量。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6489
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_d6e8f04c:

    # sy "And multiply by 100 to get the purity..."
    sy "然后乘以100得到纯度..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6491
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_a55448a7:

    # mc "Yep, you got it."
    mc "对，你理解对了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6493
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_dfe4bb9b:

    # sy "I can't believe it was this easy."
    sy "真没想到这么简单。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6495
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_d646fbdd:

    # mc "That's because we analyzed the units of measurement. It's easy to get lost if you skip that step."
    mc "那是因为我们分析了单位。如果你跳过这一步，很容易就搞混了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6497
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_d5c6c800:

    # sy "What's left?"
    sy "还有什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6499
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_c7d65051:

    # mc "We write a short conclusion about what we did right and wrong, and that should be it."
    mc "我们写个简短的结论，总结一下我们做对了什么、做错了什么，应该就完成了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6501
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_902f7a27:

    # sy "Ok, you can leave that one to me."
    sy "好，你那边就交给我吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6503
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_cfce055e:

    # mc "Are you sure?"
    mc "你确定吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6505
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_cfd75c5b:

    # sy "Yeah. You spent extra time writing the theory section; it's the least I can do."
    sy "嗯，你花了不少时间写理论部分，这事儿就让我来搞定吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6507
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_cf7944b1:

    # mc "I appreciate it."
    mc "我明白。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6512
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_d31031e9:

    # sy "So, what's that party you're planning?"
    sy "那圣诞派对你打算怎么搞？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6514
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_5336ea2b:

    # mc "It's the Christmas party."
    mc "这是圣诞派对。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6516
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_75084f1e:

    # sy "Ah, figures."
    sy "唉，真有你的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6518
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_9dff75cd:

    # mc "Wanna come?"
    mc "你来不来？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6520
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_531bfbf1:

    # sy "Sure."
    sy "当然。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6522
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_1c53cae6:

    # mc "Um... About the theme... It's gonna be a hybrid party because of reasons."
    mc "嗯……关于主题嘛，因为某些原因，这会是一个混合派对。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6525
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_98b65567:

    # sy "A hybrid of what?"
    sy "什么混合的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6527
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_2182c8a6:

    # mc "Christmas and underwear. It's a Christmas Panty party."
    mc "圣诞和内衣。这是圣诞内衣派对。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6529
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_c15cf189:

    # sy "I swear, you guys always do these things. I'd have to show up in my underwear?"
    sy "我发誓，你们这些人总是这样。我得穿着内衣去参加派对？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6531
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_80e281f6:

    # mc "Yeah, but there will be masks for those who want one."
    mc "当然，不过那些想戴面具的人也可以戴。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6533
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_04000429:

    # sy "Can I cover my private parts with it?"
    sy "我能用它遮住私处吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6535
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_350b7073:

    # mc "Haha, no."
    mc "哈哈，没这回事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6537
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_5ee18d23:

    # sy "Then probably no... We'll see."
    sy "那大概就没必要了……我们看看情况吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6540
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_a07aa702:

    # sy "And...done! I'll mail you a copy and submit the report to Dr. Jenkins."
    sy "搞定啦！我寄一份给你，同时把报告提交给詹金斯博士。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6542
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_8853ad00:

    # mc "Good job. It went smoother than I dared to hope."
    mc "干得不错。比我敢想的还要顺利。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6544
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_42c6747a:

    # sy "Likewise."
    sy "同样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6547
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_f8438893:

    # sy "Wanna study some before class? Like, later this week or whenever?"
    sy "想先一起复习一下吗？比如这周或者什么时候都行？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6549
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_224a048c:

    # mc "Maybe not this week, but someday, sure. How about if I shoot you a message when I plan on dropping by the library?"
    mc "也许这周不行，但总有一天，肯定行。等我打算去图书馆的时候，发个消息给你怎么样？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6551
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_067a1408:

    # sy "Sounds good. Don't forget about it."
    sy "听起来不错。别忘了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6554
translate schinese ep11_sally_label_7dc17e6d:

    # mc "(I knew she wasn't all bad.)"
    mc "（我知道她也不是全坏。）"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6566
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_59b64f72:

    # ji "Happy Birthday, Sis."
    ji "生日快乐，姐姐。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6567
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_1fb367e0:

    # ji "You probably already guessed what you're getting this year."
    ji "你大概已经猜到今年会收到什么了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6569
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_13af4f93:

    # isa "Happy Birthday, Lana."
    isa "生日快乐，Lana。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6571
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_14d79196:

    # isa "Her grave is as pretty as last year."
    isa "她坟头的花和去年一样漂亮。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6573
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_253e8bb1:

    # ji "Thank you for coming with me."
    ji "谢谢你能陪我一起来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6575
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_baf75fa6:

    # isa "I'm glad you asked me to."
    isa "我挺高兴你问我来这儿的原因。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6577
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_dd9fbc8a:

    # ji "You didn't even ask why I wanted you to come here again."
    ji "你连问我为什么叫你来这儿的原因都没问过。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6579
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_0dd72189:

    # isa "Oh? Was there a particular reason?"
    isa "哦？有特别的原因吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6581
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_ce852adb:

    # ji "Lately, I've been thinking a lot about her. And a lot of bad feelings resurfaced."
    ji "最近我一直在想她，很多不好的情绪又重新浮现了出来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6583
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_339a9a00:

    # isa "I'm sorry to hear that."
    isa "很遗憾听到你这么说。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6585
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_2b676b75:

    # ji "I think something triggered me at that Thanksgiving barbecue."
    ji "我觉得那次感恩节烧烤触发了我什么。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6587
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_f3f4dc39:

    # ji "When I realized that [name] and his friends were on drugs, it was hard to stop thinking about Lana."
    ji "当我发现[name]和他的朋友们都在嗑药时，就怎么也忍不住想起Lana。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6589
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_e9dae04d:

    # isa "[name] was on drugs?"
    isa "[name]也嗑药了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6591
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_026784d5:

    # ji "He was. They had eaten mushrooms and were noticeably intoxicated."
    ji "他确实用了。他们吃了蘑菇，明显处于醉醺醺的状态。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6594
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_fb623a7e:

    # isa "..."
    isa "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6597
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_d843a176:

    # isa "That makes me surprised and sad to hear."
    isa "这让我既惊讶又难过。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6599
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_bd2f9803:

    # ji "I did not expect that from him."
    ji "我没想到他会这样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6601
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_936df3ca:

    # ji "When I realized that some of the guys were on drugs, it was hard to stop thinking about Lana."
    ji "当我意识到有些家伙在嗑药时，就一直停不下来地想着Lana。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6603
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_ca9c0200:

    # isa "What kind of drugs?"
    isa "什么毒品？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6605
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_5a597e4e:

    # ji "I believe they had eaten mushrooms or something and were noticeably affected."
    ji "我想他们可能是吃了些蘑菇之类的，明显受到了影响。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6606
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_c36d349c:

    # ji "They all acted weirdly during the evening, and it was concerning."
    ji "他们那晚表现得怪怪的，让人很担心。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6608
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_47246305:

    # isa "I can see how that triggered you."
    isa "我能理解这事儿对你来说有多刺激。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6610
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_82a20e84:

    # ji "It made me think about Lana and Jonathan. And I remembered the bad years before I talked to Jonathan again."
    ji "这让我想起了Lana和Jonathan。我还记得在我再次见到Jonathan之前的那些糟糕日子。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6611
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_df53b81b:

    # ji "I used to be so mad at him."
    ji "我以前真的很恨他。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6613
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_89a90e69:

    # ji "Like, how could this nice guy who was wonderful to me and my sister be the reason my sister died?"
    ji "像，怎么这个对我和我妹妹都很好的好男人，会是导致我妹妹死的原因？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6614
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_06a321b5:

    # ji "Mom told me it was his fault, and I believed her."
    ji "我妈说这是他的错，我当时信了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6616
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_21931789:

    # ji "Did I tell you that I ran into him at the mall once?"
    ji "我有没有告诉过你，我曾在商场碰到过他？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6618
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_65db7723:

    # isa "Remind me."
    isa "提醒我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6620
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_fcd83f2a:

    # ji "It was some years before I met you. I didn't expect to see Jonathan there; he was far from my mind."
    ji "那是几年后我才遇见你。我没想到会在这里看到Jonathan；他根本没在我脑子里。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6621
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_3f0206a0:

    # ji "But the moment I saw him..."
    ji "但看到他的那一刻……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6628
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_59b64f72_1:

    # ji "Happy Birthday, Sis."
    ji "生日快乐，姐姐。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6629
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_1fb367e0_1:

    # ji "You probably already guessed what you're getting this year."
    ji "你大概已经猜到今年会收到什么了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6631
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_c17ef8ec:

    # mc "What's that?"
    mc "那是什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6632
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_5279620f:

    # ji "It's a birthday gift I never got to give her."
    ji "这是我本该送给她却没能送出的生日礼物。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6633
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_665dc349:

    # ji "I made it at school for her birthday. Perhaps it's hard to tell, but that's supposed to be her if she were a troll."
    ji "我在学校为她生日做的。也许很难看出来，但那是她如果变成一个恶作剧者的样子。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6637
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_1febce68:

    # ji "Haha! It's so ugly."
    ji "哈哈！这玩意儿真丑。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6639
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_da674fdd:

    # mc "Haha! It has its...charm."
    mc "哈哈！它也有点...魅力。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6640
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_ffc9fffe:

    # ji "I give it to her every year, along with flowers and a candle. It has become a tradition."
    ji "每年我都会给她送这个，还有花和蜡烛。这已经成了一个传统。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6645
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_59774dc0:

    # mc "It's peaceful here."
    mc "这里挺安静的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6650
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_845dfeea:

    # ji "Isn't it? It's a nice place for her final rest."
    ji "是不是啊？这里对她来说是个不错的安息之地。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6655
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_9e4f91a0:

    # mc "How does it feel coming here? Does it make you sad?"
    mc "来这儿感觉怎么样？会让你难过吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6660
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_37237830:

    # ji "I feel somber yet weirdly calm."
    ji "我感觉有点忧郁，却又奇怪地平静。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6661
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_69214910:

    # ji "I used to cry a lot coming here, but now I don't."
    ji "我以前每次来都会哭很多，但现在不会了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6663
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_4b8b66d1:

    # ji "It's not that her grave has lost its meaning, but I've processed her death for so long."
    ji "这并不是她的墓地失去了意义，而是我早就接受了她的离去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6664
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_8e066225:

    # ji "I don't think Lana would want me to show up on her birthday every year to cry."
    ji "我不觉得Lana会希望我每年生日都来这儿哭。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6666
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_9bb411f3:

    # ji "This year, I brought you here. She would have wanted to meet you."
    ji "今年，我带你来了。她一定想见见你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6668
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_2cacdf7e:

    # mc "Do you think Lana and I would have gotten along?"
    mc "你觉得我和你俩能合得来吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6670
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_440cf52e:

    # ji "Like a house on fire."
    ji "像房子着了火一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6673
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_fc87c829:

    # ji "Even with the drugs..."
    ji "即使有毒品……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6675
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_2cf02b6b:

    # ji "Probably not with the drugs..."
    ji "大概不会，有药的话……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6677
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_721d4483:

    # mc "What do you mean by that?"
    mc "你这话是什么意思？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6680
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_03f24325:

    # ji "I should have told you this earlier, but it's not something I enjoy bringing up."
    ji "我应该早点告诉你这件事，但有些事我并不喜欢提起。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6682
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_c1b225f0:

    # ji "I haven't told you this, but it's not something I enjoy bringing up."
    ji "我还没告诉你这件事，但有些事我实在不想提起。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6683
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_6aca0159:

    # ji "It's about how my sister died."
    ji "就是关于我姐姐是怎么死的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6685
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_1f97db06:

    # ji "When I was young, Mom and Dad told me it was an accident. And they tried to spare me from the details."
    ji "小时候，爸妈跟我说那是意外。他们还尽量瞒着我那些细节。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6686
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_6fe4c9e9:

    # ji "But when I grew older, I wanted to hear the full version about how she died."
    ji "但当我长大后，我想知道她到底是怎么死的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6688
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_7192de32:

    # ji "Mom told me she died because of drugs and that it was her boyfriend's fault."
    ji "我妈跟我说她是因为吸毒去世的，而且责任在她男朋友身上。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6690
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_9175311c:

    # ji "Lana had a boyfriend named Jonathan. He was the son of one of Dad's acquaintances."
    ji "Lana有个男朋友叫Jonathan，他是爸爸一个熟人儿子。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6691
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_8a0eb06a:

    # ji "He was always nice to me and got along very well with Lana. That's how they got together."
    ji "他一直对我很好，和Lana也相处得很融洽，就是这么认识的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6693
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_26f1bd21:

    # ji "When Mom told me it was his fault that Lana died, I was so mad at him."
    ji "当我妈妈告诉我就是他害死了Lana，我气得恨不得杀了他。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6694
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_130627db:

    # ji "He didn't even show up at her funeral, and he was the reason I lost my sister."
    ji "他连她葬礼都没来，而他就是让我失去妹妹的元凶。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6696
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_735195d2:

    # ji "I ran into him at the mall a few years ago, and it was like I couldn't breathe."
    ji "几年前我在商场碰到他，当时我喘不过气来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6697
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_2866fb68:

    # ji "Looking into his eyes, all I saw was my sister."
    ji "望着他的眼睛，我只看到我姐姐。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6698
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_b63fac50:

    # ji "I could see the panic in his eyes as he spotted me."
    ji "我能看出他看到我时眼里的恐慌。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6699
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_bebad056:

    # ji "I couldn't hold it together, so I ran in the other direction crying. I ran far from him."
    ji "我实在撑不住了，转身就往反方向跑，边跑边哭。我远远地躲开了他。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6704
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_730e3a18:

    # ji "Not that long after, I received a letter from him. He wanted to meet me and talk about Lana."
    ji "不久之后，我收到了他的来信。他想见我，谈谈Lana。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6705
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_a341b0e7:

    # ji "He wanted to explain what had happened and how he felt, which surprised me."
    ji "他想解释发生了什么，以及他当时的感觉，这让我很意外。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6706
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_a44d903a:

    # ji "Why would he want to do that? Why care now when he hasn't cared for so many years about Lana or me?"
    ji "他为什么现在突然想这么做？为什么现在才关心，这么多年都不曾关心过我或者Lana？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6709
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_3bbe4d5f:

    # ji "It took all my courage to meet up with him to talk."
    ji "我鼓起全部的勇气才去见了他，跟他谈谈。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6712
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_66ae4872:

    # mc "What did you do? Did you meet up with him?"
    mc "你见到他了吗？你跟他见面了没？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6714
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_08c3a0c0:

    # ji "It took all my courage, but I did. I was so nervous."
    ji "我鼓起全部的勇气，还是去见了他。当时我紧张得不行。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6719
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_8957639f:

    # than "You came."
    than "你来了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6721
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_bd797ba0:

    # ji "..."
    ji "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6723
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_558bd129:

    # ji "I needed to hear what you had to say."
    ji "我需要听你说说你的想法。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6725
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_4bee4121:

    # than "Where do I even begin?"
    than "我从哪儿说起才好？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6727
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_5c611ac5:

    # ji "*{i}Breathing heavily{/i}* Maybe you could explain why you killed my sister and didn't have the courage to care about us after!?"
    ji "*{i}喘着粗气{/i}* 也许你能解释一下，为什么你害死了我姐姐，之后却连关心我们一下的勇气都没有！？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6729
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_e67eeff2:

    # than "..."
    than "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6731
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_edaa3cee:

    # than "I didn't kill your sister, but I used to blame myself for her death for a long time. I don't anymore."
    than "我没杀你姐姐，但我曾经很长一段时间都责怪自己。现在不这么想了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6733
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_df1cf566:

    # ji "How can you say that!?"
    ji "你怎么能这么说！？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6735
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_c80e0579:

    # than "I loved Lana. And I still do."
    than "我爱上了Lana。而且我到现在还是这样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6736
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_f620336c:

    # than "I tried talking her out of trying cocaine, but she insisted."
    than "我试着劝她别碰可卡因，但她坚持要试试。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6737
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_dac4a3bd:

    # than "And since it was her birthday wish...I caved and got her some."
    than "而且因为那是她生日的愿望……我终于妥协，给她买了点东西。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6739
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_2b850d12:

    # ji "*{i}Sobs{/i}*"
    ji "*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6741
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_ede75304:

    # than "But I couldn't have known that the cocaine was poisoned."
    than "可我根本不可能知道那批可卡因被掺了毒。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6743
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_d53b1212:

    # ji "What?"
    ji "什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6745
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_3d357120:

    # than "The coke they sold me that night... It was laced with fentanyl. It's something dealers add to dilute the drug to sell more for less product."
    than "那晚他们卖给我的可卡因……里面掺了芬太尼。这是毒贩用来稀释毒品的，这样能卖更多货，赚更多钱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6746
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_d4b163d8:

    # than "But they must have put too much in it, which ended up killing Lana."
    than "但他们在里面加了太多，结果害死了Lana。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6750
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_559babc8:

    # than "At the party, down to the last moments before she used it, I tried to talk her out of it."
    than "在派对上，她用之前，我一直在试图劝她别用。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6752
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_9e91fdc7:

    # than "She was going to use it no matter what I said."
    than "她管我说什么都照样要用了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6753
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_0fc9466d:

    # than "She thought I was a hypocrite for buying it in the first place if I was going to tell her not to use it."
    than "她觉得我买毒品本身就是个伪善者，还跟我说不要用。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6755
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_1bd8e90a:

    # than "She got annoyed, and I told her, \"Fine, do what you want. But I don't wanna watch it\"."
    than "她有点不高兴，我跟她说：“行啊，你想干啥就干啥。但我可不想看着你干。”"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6756
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_962bc687:

    # than "I headed outside to smoke with my friends."
    than "我出去和朋友们抽了根烟。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6758
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_8b105c52:

    # than "When I came back inside to check on her, I found her dozing off on the couch."
    than "当我回到屋里查看她的时候，发现她正躺在沙发上打盹。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6760
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_bfd3d522:

    # than "Only that she..."
    than "只有她……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6762
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_e67eeff2_1:

    # than "..."
    than "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6764
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_81788fdd:

    # than "She wasn't sleeping. She had foam coming from her mouth, and her lips were blue."
    than "她没在睡觉，嘴里冒着泡沫，嘴唇都发紫了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6766
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_f79a094f:

    # than "We tried to give her CPR while we waited for the paramedics, but there wasn't anything we could do. She was already gone."
    than "我们试着给她做心肺复苏，等救护车来了，但什么也做不了。她已经走了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6768
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_647f084b:

    # than "She was declared dead on arrival. But I went with her to the hospital even so."
    than "她到达医院时就被宣布死亡。但我还是跟她一起去了医院。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6770
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_211842a6:

    # than "I faced your parents, and tried to explain myself to them. They were devastated and inconsolable."
    than "我面对了你们的父母，试图向他们解释一切。他们当时崩溃得无法自拔，根本无法安慰。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6771
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_f3624aad:

    # than "As was I."
    than "我也是。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6773
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_094ad294:

    # than "The coward that I was couldn't even admit that it was me who got her the coke."
    than "我这个胆小鬼连承认是我给她拿了可乐都不敢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6774
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_d5a5e3fe:

    # than "But it didn't matter. I could tell from everyone's looks that I was to blame."
    than "但这没关系。我能从每个人的表情看出来，都是我的错。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6775
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_7f12581a:

    # than "I wanted to come to the funeral, but they told me I wasn't welcome."
    than "我想去参加她的葬礼，但他们告诉我我不被欢迎。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6777
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_ee5ee735:

    # than "I still came to say my goodbyes, but I kept myself at a distance out of respect for your family."
    than "我还是来了，想最后道别，但为了尊重你的家人，我保持了一段距离。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6778
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_40bbc2ca:

    # than "Letting go of Lana has been the hardest struggle of my life."
    than "放下Lana是我这辈子最难熬的挣扎。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6779
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_2cd5576f:

    # than "I've gone through years of therapy and dedicated my career to Lana's memory."
    than "我经历了多年的治疗，把我的职业生涯献给了Lana的纪念。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6781
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_dc53075e:

    # ji "Your career? How?"
    ji "你的事业？怎么搞的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6783
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_3b471dfb:

    # than "I give lectures on drug use to young adults and how it can ruin your life."
    than "我给年轻人做讲座，讲毒品的危害以及它如何毁掉一个人的生活。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6784
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_b55376d3:

    # than "And I've started a support group for survivors and victims of drug use and abuse."
    than "并且我开始了一个针对毒品使用和滥用幸存者与受害者的支持小组。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6785
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_9da8f92e:

    # than "We meet every Wednesday to talk and process the drug-related events that have changed our lives."
    than "我们每个星期三见面，一起聊聊那些改变我们生活的毒品相关经历。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6787
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_46aafc71:

    # than "To provide comfort and be heard in that setting is meaningful for everyone who attends."
    than "在那个环境中，能被倾听和得到安慰，对每个人来说都意义重大。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6788
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_33cf6364:

    # than "It becomes a part of everyone's healing process, and the group has helped many battle their inner demons."
    than "这成为了每个人康复过程的一部分，这个团体帮助很多人战胜了内心的恶魔。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6792
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_e64af21b:

    # ji "Do you talk about my sister there?"
    ji "你在那里会提到我姐姐吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6794
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_b08d2476:

    # than "Sometimes, I do. When there are newcomers, and no one feels like sharing their stories, I talk about Lana."
    than "有时候我会提到她。当有新成员加入，大家都不愿意开口的时候，我会讲讲Lana的故事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6795
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_85667b8d:

    # than "Your sister's story has a way of making people open up and talk."
    than "你姐姐的故事总能让大家敞开心扉，开始说话。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6797
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_bd797ba0_1:

    # ji "..."
    ji "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6799
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_297bff3f:

    # than "Would you like to come? You don't have to share anything about Lana unless you want to."
    than "你想来吗？你不需要说任何关于Lana的事情，除非你愿意。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6800
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_84c3b232:

    # than "You could just be there and listen. Come and see for yourself how your sister's story helps people."
    than "你只需要在那里听着就行。来亲眼看看你姐姐的故事到底能帮到多少人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6808
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_bbfbb4b2:

    # ji "All those feelings resurfaced at the barbecue."
    ji "所有那些感觉又涌上来了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6809
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_b252b1a4:

    # ji "To see them use drugs like that, knowing how it could go horribly wrong, it bothered me. But I didn't speak up."
    ji "看到他们那样使用毒品，知道事情可能会变得非常糟糕，这让我很不安。但我没说出来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6810
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_a72974cc:

    # ji "If something bad had happened, would I have felt like Jonathan?"
    ji "如果出了什么坏事，我会不会变得像Jonathan那样？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6812
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_71c4bf2c:

    # isa "I understand you. But you can't control what others do."
    isa "我明白你的意思。但你无法控制别人做什么。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6813
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_646f75b3:

    # isa "They don't have the same experience and look at life differently."
    isa "他们经历的事情不一样，看待生活的方式也不同。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6814
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_c70a2ab5:

    # isa "As sad as it is, experimenting with drugs is common. I mean, even I smoked pot when I was in college."
    isa "虽然挺让人难受的，但吸毒这种事在学生里其实挺常见的。我说真的，就连我上大学的时候也抽过大麻。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6816
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_a98fa37b:

    # ji "I know. *{i}Sigh{/i}* But seeing it happen in front of me made me feel bad."
    ji "我知道。*{i}叹气{/i}* 但亲眼看着那一幕发生，我心里还是很难受。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6818
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_75f9512c:

    # ji "And seeing [name] on drugs... That was the hardest part."
    ji "而看到[name]也在嗑药……那才是最难受的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6822
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_e2943c62:

    # ji "Anyway... That's why it felt extra good to have you here today."
    ji "不管怎么说……今天能见到你在这里，感觉特别棒。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6823
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_d218188f:

    # ji "Thank you."
    ji "谢谢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6831
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_77c82495:

    # ji "Would you like to accompany Bianca and me to her family's cabin next weekend?"
    ji "你愿意和我一起去她家的木屋过周末吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6833
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_5e0e9b88:

    # isa "Her cabin? What are you doing there?"
    isa "她的木屋？你干嘛去那里？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6835
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_81328fa5:

    # ji "We're going skiing and having some needed R&R before the finals."
    ji "我们去滑雪，好好放松一下，为期末考试做准备。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6838
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_5318f389:

    # isa "I'd love to."
    isa "我当然愿意。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6840
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_e3a77329:

    # ji "You can bring [name] if you'd like."
    ji "你愿意的话，可以带[name]一起来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6842
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_20701dc7:

    # isa "Are you sure that would be ok?"
    isa "你确定这样没问题吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6844
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_c964c841:

    # ji "I think he'd enjoy it."
    ji "我想他一定会喜欢的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6846
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_5318f389_1:

    # isa "I'd love to."
    isa "我也想去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6850
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_87bfe2eb:

    # ji "Thank you for this time, Sis. The moon has been beautiful lately. I bet you had something to do with it. I'll see you soon."
    ji "谢谢这段时间，姐姐。最近的月亮真美。我打赌你一定有关系。很快就能见到你了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6858
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_ed4bd09f:

    # mc "I didn't realize that's how she died. I've wanted to ask but didn't want to be insensitive."
    mc "我没意识到她就是那样死去的。我一直想问，但又怕显得不敏感。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6860
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_bbfbb4b2_1:

    # ji "All those feelings resurfaced at the barbecue."
    ji "所有那些感觉在烧烤会上又涌上来了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6862
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_5f97d749:

    # ji "To see you and your friends use drugs like that, knowing how it could go horribly wrong, it bothered me."
    ji "看着你和朋友们那样使用毒品，知道可能会出大问题，这让我很不安。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6864
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_80c870ee:

    # ji "To see your friends use drugs like that, knowing how it could go horribly wrong, it bothered me. But I didn't speak up."
    ji "看到你的朋友们那样使用毒品，明明知道可能会出大问题，这让我很不安。但我没说出来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6865
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_a72974cc_1:

    # ji "If something bad had happened, would I have felt like Jonathan?"
    ji "如果出了什么坏事，我会不会变得像Jonathan那样？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6868
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_ecbee836:

    # mc "Jill..."
    mc "Jill..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:6870
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_430cc7f7:

    # ji "I'm not trying to make you feel bad about it."
    ji "我没想让你因为这事觉得难受。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6872
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_fc03828c:

    # ji "I appreciate that you promised not to do it again."
    ji "我明白你答应不再做了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6874
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave_label_21ec867b:

    # ji "But I am worried you'll keep doing it."
    ji "但我担心你会一直做下去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6882
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_83d0c0f6:

    # mc "You can't live life being scared that something will kill you. Because in the end, something will."
    mc "你不能一辈子活在害怕某天会被什么杀死的阴影里。因为最后，总会有那么一天。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6883
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_f491bc51:

    # mc "Tomorrow, you could walk in front of a bus or fall down the stairs."
    mc "明天你可能会被公交车撞到，或者从楼梯上摔下来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6885
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_018a7786:

    # ji "But you can make sensible choices."
    ji "但你可以做出明智的选择。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6887
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_9c181ebd:

    # mc "And live all sheltered? Never trying new things?"
    mc "那就要一直活在保护里？从不尝试新事物？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6888
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_da04a0cc:

    # mc "What about parachuting or bungee jumping? Bad things could happen doing that, but people still do it."
    mc "跳伞或者蹦极呢？那些事做起来也有危险，但人们还是照样去做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6890
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_eb373783:

    # ji "Maybe I'm wrong, but I don't feel like I am."
    ji "也许我错了，但我感觉不到自己错了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6892
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_d90c4634:

    # mc "We don't have to agree on everything. I'm very sorry drugs killed your sister."
    mc "我们没必要在所有事情上都意见一致。我很抱歉毒品害死了你姐姐。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6894
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_a90e8f5d:

    # ji "Me too. You two would have gotten along great, haha."
    ji "我也是。你们俩肯定能处得很好，哈哈。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6898
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_0f6d2ee3:

    # mc "I haven't looked at it the same way you do. It was a stupid thing to try with my friends."
    mc "我没用你那种眼光去看它。和朋友一起尝试这种事真是个蠢主意。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6899
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_3dca5574:

    # mc "Maybe it was peer pressure, but I didn't think it would be harmful."
    mc "也许是因为同伴压力，但我没觉得会有什么害处。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6901
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_a79fa2aa:

    # ji "Lana didn't think it would be harmful either. That's all I'm saying."
    ji "Lana 也没觉得会有害。那只是我想说的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6903
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_5f34f791:

    # mc "You're right. I should have thought more about it."
    mc "你说得对，我当时应该多想想。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6905
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_d218188f:

    # ji "Thank you."
    ji "谢谢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6913
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_2c3f098f:

    # mc "I haven't looked at it the same way you do. But it was a stupid thing they did."
    mc "我没用你那种眼光去看它。但他们在那儿做那事真是蠢透了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6915
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_e1482ea6:

    # mc "Maybe I should have told them not to use it, but I figured they could decide for themselves."
    mc "也许我本该阻止他们用那个东西，但我以为他们自己能做决定。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6917
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_484b87cf:

    # mc "I did try stopping them, but they still wanted to try it."
    mc "我确实试着阻止他们，但他们还是想试试看。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6919
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_47c15f33:

    # mc "That's how guys are at times. We do stupid things for laughs and try things for fun."
    mc "这就是有时候男生的做派，为了搞笑做些蠢事，为了好玩尝试些东西。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6920
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_8f15504c:

    # mc "They weren't thinking about how it could be harmful when they chose to eat those shrooms."
    mc "他们当时根本没想过吃那些蘑菇会有什么害处。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6922
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_a79fa2aa_1:

    # ji "Lana didn't think it would be harmful either. That's all I'm saying."
    ji "Lana也不觉得会有害。那只是我想说的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6924
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_dff79cab:

    # mc "You're right."
    mc "你说得对。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6926
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_d218188f_1:

    # ji "Thank you."
    ji "谢谢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6928
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_08f90f1d:

    # ji "Like Jonathan devoted his career to the memory of Lana, I want to do something similar for her as well."
    ji "就像Jonathan把他的职业生涯献给了兰娜的纪念，我也想为她做点类似的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6929
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_c1a4bd90:

    # ji "I'm meeting him later this month to discuss a campaign to raise awareness about substance abuse."
    ji "我这个月晚些时候要跟他见面，讨论一个提高人们对药物滥用意识的宣传活动。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6930
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_23601efd:

    # ji "It's something I've wanted to do for a long time."
    ji "这是我一直想做的事情。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6931
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_a77fea33:

    # mc "If it means that much to you, you should do it."
    mc "如果你真的这么在意，那就去做吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6932
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_337f757b:

    # ji "It does. Thanks for listening."
    ji "有这回事。谢谢你的倾听。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6933
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_aa50b32a:

    # mc "Thanks for sharing."
    mc "谢谢你的倾听。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6937
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_d8d6accb:

    # ji "About something else... Something merrier... I've been thinking of fun things to do together during winter."
    ji "关于别的事情……更开心的事情……我一直在想冬天一起做些有趣的事情。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6939
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_f3687664:

    # mc "Tell me about them."
    mc "跟我说说她们。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6941
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_77c82495:

    # ji "Would you like to accompany Bianca and me to her family's cabin next weekend?"
    ji "你愿意和布兰卡还有我一起去她家的木屋过周末吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6944
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_3a15da87:

    # ji "About something else... Something merrier... Would you like to accompany Bianca and me to her family's cabin next weekend?"
    ji "关于别的事……更开心的事……你愿意和Bianca还有我一起去她家的木屋过周末吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6946
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_876c38a6:

    # mc "A cabin? Where is it?"
    mc "小木屋？在哪儿？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6949
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_da5c629e:

    # ji "It's some hours away from here by car. Woods and mountains surround it, and I think it's a perfect opportunity for me to teach you how to ski."
    ji "它开车要好几个小时才能到。周围都是树林和山，我觉得这是个教你怎么滑雪的好机会。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6951
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_0c7f1349:

    # ji "It's some hours away from here by car. Woods and mountains surround it and offer a great opportunity to ski."
    ji "开车要好几个小时才能到那儿。周围都是树林和山，非常适合滑雪。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6953
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_bac6329a:

    # mc "Mountains, woods, snow, skiing... That's a lot of things I don't like."
    mc "山、树林、雪、滑雪……这玩意儿我可一点都不喜欢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6956
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_c174b728:

    # ji "Haha, I know. It's the point of it and part of our deal. To make you come around on winter."
    ji "哈，我知道。这就是我们约定的意义，也是我们交易的一部分。就是要让你在冬天被说服过来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6958
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_c1212b1f:

    # mc "But what about my finals? I need to study, don't you?"
    mc "但我的期末考试怎么办？我得复习，你不用吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6960
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_f03f72ff:

    # ji "I will cram extra during next week so I can take a couple of days off."
    ji "我会在接下来的一周里拼命复习，这样就能请几天假了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6962
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_a95c56ce:

    # mc "Ok... Let's do it."
    mc "好……就这么定了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6964
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_c64335a6:

    # ji "Do you mean it?"
    ji "你真打算去吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6966
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_e631fb85:

    # mc "I promised, didn't I? So, you, me and Bianca, is it?"
    mc "我可没食言，对吧？所以，你、我，还有Bianca，就这么定了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6968
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_a3920f6c:

    # ji "I'm asking Bella, too. I'm sure she'll love it."
    ji "我也在问贝拉，我确定她会喜欢的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6970
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_87da589e:

    # mc "It does sound fun."
    mc "听起来挺好玩的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6973
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_880b6410:

    # ji "I was thinking it would be nice to get away together. I'm asking Bella, too."
    ji "我在想，我们一起去外面玩一下应该挺不错的。我也会问问贝拉。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6975
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_625fb499:

    # mc "I'm not sure I have time for it, with my finals and all."
    mc "我不确定我有没有时间，毕竟还有期末考试呢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6977
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_8beedd6f:

    # ji "I will cram extra during next week so I can take a couple of days off. You could do that, too."
    ji "我下星期会加把劲儿，争取多腾出几天时间。你也可以这么做。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6979
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_a95c56ce_1:

    # mc "Ok... Let's do it."
    mc "好……那就这么定了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6982
translate schinese ep11_jill_grave2_label_87bfe2eb:

    # ji "Thank you for this time, Sis. The moon has been beautiful lately. I bet you had something to do with it. I'll see you soon."
    ji "姐，今天谢谢你陪着我。最近月亮特别美，一定有你的功劳吧。我会再来看你的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:6998
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_be69acb4:

    # ca "I'm shocked and...angry hearing that. It feels like rain from a clear sky."
    ca "听到这些，我既震惊又……生气。简直是晴天霹雳。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7000
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_16e8f4f4:

    # ja "Trust me, there hasn't been a clear sky in years. It's been perpetually cloudy, and the thunderstorm has finally started."
    ja "信我，这几年天都没晴过。一直阴着，现在终于开始打雷下雨了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7002
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_98e3e642:

    # ca "Have you considered couples therapy?"
    ca "你考虑过婚姻咨询吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7004
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_d0e14103:

    # ja "Hah, therapy! That's rich. Try getting Stephen to open up about anything other than sports and money."
    ja "哈，咨询！真是笑话。你倒是试试让Stephen敞开心扉，聊点体育和钱以外的事。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7005
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_0cf4794d:

    # ja "No therapist in this world would make a dent in his rock-hard shell."
    ja "他把自己包得严严实实，世上没有哪个心理咨询师能让他敞开心扉。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7007
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_82145650:

    # ja "He's determined to go through with it. He has already signed the divorce papers. All that's left is for me to decide what to do."
    ja "他已经铁了心要离，离婚协议都签了。现在就看我怎么决定了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7009
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_e19f3f72:

    # ca "I'm so sorry... So, the divorce is inevitable?"
    ca "真替你难过……所以，离婚已经无法避免了吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7011
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_c832bf21:

    # ja "It's now a matter of going through a mediator or separation lawyer."
    ja "现在只剩下找调解员，还是找离婚律师的问题了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7013
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_d8f83bc8:

    # ca "As I understand, all divorce lawyers care about is inflicting maximum damage to maximize their earnings."
    ca "我听说所有离婚律师唯一在乎的就是怎么搞出最大矛盾来赚最多的钱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7014
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_a0329f7d:

    # ca "It would be best and fair for everyone if you can reach an agreement through mediation."
    ca "要是能通过调解达成协议，对双方都最好，也最公平。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7017
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_27eef3df:

    # ja "Nothing would be fair. Stephen wants me to agree on a 90/10 split, even without a prenup."
    ja "哪有什么公平可言。我们连婚前协议都没签，Stephen却想让我接受九一分。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7019
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_a13380b2:

    # ca "That's ridiculous! He can't be serious."
    ca "太荒唐了！他不会是认真的吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7021
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_8d9cad9d:

    # ja "Oh, he is serious."
    ja "他认真的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7023
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_2edfbe0a:

    # ca "He sounds delusional. If you take it to court, I doubt he'd even get close to that."
    ca "他简直是在做梦。真要闹上法庭，我不信他能拿到接近这个数。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7025
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_e615642a:

    # ja "He said I could get half if I wanted. But..."
    ja "他说我想要的话可以给我一半。但..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:7027
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_99c543c9:

    # ca "But what?"
    ca "但是什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7029
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_85b9a9b0:

    # ja "I don't think I should say... He has leverage, and he's using it."
    ja "我不知道该不该说……他手里有我的把柄，而且正拿来要挟我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7031
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_c81cea05:

    # ca "What did you do?"
    ca "你做了什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7033
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_976aa0fa:

    # ja "Nothing that he hasn't done. The only difference is that he can prove it."
    ja "我做过的事，他也都做过。唯一的区别是，他手里有证据。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7035
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_0171750f:

    # ca "Is he blackmailing you?"
    ca "他是在勒索你吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7037
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_f0fc7987:

    # ja "Yes. There's no other way to describe it. He could ruin my career and what's left of my family."
    ja "是的，没法用别的词来形容。他能毁掉我的事业，还有我这个家仅剩的一切。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7039
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_d69cc930:

    # ca "It must be some damning evidence."
    ca "这一定是些能毁掉人的证据。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7041
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_4ca8fae4:

    # ja "I had sex with a student. And Stephen has video proof of it."
    ja "我跟一个学生发生了关系。而且Stephen有视频证据。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7044
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_8840aa2f:

    # ja "And to make matters worse, this student is in a relationship with my daughter."
    ja "更糟的是，这个学生跟我女儿在一起。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7045
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_b18837a5:

    # ja "And before you ask me, no, I wasn't aware that I fucked my daughter's boyfriend."
    ja "不用问了，我当时根本不知道自己睡的是女儿的男朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7046
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_ecba0c8b:

    # ja "I would never have done that knowingly. But I have a hard time Sage would believe me, and even if she did, would she ever forgive me?"
    ja "我要是知道，绝不会那么做。可Sage恐怕不会相信我。就算信了，她又会原谅我吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7049
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_f0d840c7:

    # ja "And to make matters worse, this student is a close friend of my daughter."
    ja "而且更糟的是，这个学生是我女儿的好朋友。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7050
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_4a949704:

    # ja "I have a hard time imagining she'd forgive me for doing this with any student, let alone her friend."
    ja "我很难想象她能原谅我跟任何学生发生这种事，更别说她的朋友了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7052
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_00fb4568:

    # ca "..."
    ca "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:7056
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_6182e5a7:

    # ja "I see that you grasp the situation I'm in."
    ja "看来你已经明白我的处境了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7057
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_b5fff581:

    # ja "What choice does he leave me with? I have to accept the 10%%, or I'd risk losing everything that means something to me."
    ja "他还给我留了什么选择？我要么接受那10%%，要么就冒着失去所有珍视之物的风险。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7063
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_f60c6b77:

    # ja "Will you say something?"
    ja "你倒是说句话啊。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7065
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_613cb99c:

    # ca "My head is in many places at once, so you must forgive me."
    ca "抱歉，我脑子里一下子涌出了太多想法。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7066
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_9c4c6eca:

    # ca "I'm guessing that 10%% is still a lot of money and assets for you."
    ca "我想，就算只有10%%，也还是相当可观的一笔钱和资产吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7067
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_e53f6a98:

    # ca "It's not like you'd end up on the streets."
    ca "这不意味着你就要流落街头。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7069
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_8ff0470a:

    # ja "I would have to move."
    ja "我得搬出去。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7071
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_08675631:

    # ca "Wouldn't that still be the case if you got 50%%? Why would you want to live in a home tainted by him?"
    ca "就算你拿到50%%，不也一样得搬吗？你为什么还想住在那个留下他污点的家里？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7073
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_210599e9:

    # ja "It's more than money and the actual apartment. It's my pride and the symbolic meaning of agreeing to his terms."
    ja "这不只是钱和那间公寓的事。还有我的尊严，还有同意他条件所象征的意义。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7074
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_1daf49ea:

    # ja "Men always have it easier. Stephen has always gotten opportunities he didn't deserve or worked hard enough for."
    ja "男人做什么都更容易。Stephen总能得到本不该属于他的机会，付出的努力也根本不够。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7076
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_78274433:

    # ja "And now, he wants to silence me and rob me of the fortune we made together as a family."
    ja "现在，他又想堵住我的嘴，夺走我们一家人共同积攒的财富。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7077
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_c129c2f0:

    # ja "It cuts deep."
    ja "这真的让我很受伤。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7081
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_14d9256e:

    # ca "I can only imagine how angry you must feel."
    ca "我只能想象你此刻有多愤怒。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7082
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_35014e18:

    # ca "As your friend, I will always support you, regardless of your choice. But I would advise you to meet with a lawyer and hear what they say."
    ca "作为你的朋友，我永远支持你，不管你的决定是什么。但我要建议你找个律师谈谈，听听他们的意见。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7084
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_9951dc64:

    # ja "We have joint accounts; Stephen will monitor my transactions. The moment he learns I've met with a lawyer is the moment I lose."
    ja "我们用的是联名账户，Stephen会盯着我的每一笔交易。他一旦知道我见了律师，我就输了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7085
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_e2fb86cd:

    # ja "He's not bluffing, Cathy. He would use that video against me."
    ja "Cathy，他不是在虚张声势。他真的会用那段录像来对付我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7087
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_99a578a5:

    # ja "And all of this happened because I wanted to get back at him..."
    ja "都是因为我想要报复他才发生的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7088
translate schinese ep11_cathy_jade_label_aaecd604:

    # ja "No... All of this happened because [name] decided to screw me over with that recording."
    ja "不……这一切都怪[name]，是他用那段录像坑了我。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:7090
