# episode11\update11.rpy:10069
translate schinese ep11_jparty_label_07a1eb07:

    # al "Didn't you already say it was ours?"
    al "你不是已经说了这是我们的了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10071
translate schinese ep11_jparty_label_d4dfaf97:

    # dw "Yeah, but it's even more ours now."
    dw "现在这玩意儿更属于我们了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10074
translate schinese ep11_jparty_label_b4a09314_1:

    # dw "Sage!"
    dw "Sage！"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10083
translate schinese ep11_md_label_6cf47a70:

    # my "Hey, Dad."
    my "嘿，爸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10085
translate schinese ep11_md_label_9c97fa00:

    # pa "Your mom's resting. She's having a bad day."
    pa "你妈在休息，她今天状态不太好。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10087
translate schinese ep11_md_label_005ab606:

    # my "Is she sleeping?"
    my "她睡着了吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10089
translate schinese ep11_md_label_fae4316b:

    # pa "She's on the verge of it."
    pa "快睡着了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10090
translate schinese ep11_md_label_cfbaeb60:

    # pa "Come on in."
    pa "进来吧。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10092
translate schinese ep11_md_label_478fa2ec:

    # pa "You two are looking nice. What's the occasion?"
    pa "你们俩看起来不错，有什么喜事吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10094
translate schinese ep11_md_label_d10a90f6:

    # de "We're celebrating Christmas tonight with friends."
    de "我们今晚和朋友一起庆祝圣诞节。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10096
translate schinese ep11_md_label_20d4fc57:

    # pa "Already? It's not even the weekend."
    pa "这么早就庆祝？这还没到周末呢。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10097
translate schinese ep11_md_label_68191240:

    # pa "So, that's why you need the car."
    pa "所以你们需要车就是这个原因。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10099
translate schinese ep11_md_label_a3311db4:

    # pa "I'm happy you came... There's something I'd like to talk to you about..."
    pa "我很高兴你们来了……有件事我想和你谈谈……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10102
translate schinese ep11_md_label_1ff1d319:

    # my "We need to talk to you, too."
    my "我们也要和你谈谈。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10104
translate schinese ep11_md_label_33cac6ea:

    # pa "Let's sit down. I made coffee."
    pa "我们坐下吧。我煮了咖啡。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10112
translate schinese ep11_md_label_bb7d0e0c:

    # pa "I've done some thinking...and it shouldn't have taken this long, but..."
    pa "我好好想了想……其实不应该拖这么久，但……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10113
translate schinese ep11_md_label_99a1eff3:

    # pa "I want to apologize for Thanksgiving. It didn't turn out the way I wanted."
    pa "我想为感恩节的事道歉。那天没按我期望的那样进行。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10118
translate schinese ep11_md_label_6a39d0a1:

    # pa "Your friends deserve an apology, too."
    pa "我也该向你们的朋友道歉。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10120
translate schinese ep11_md_label_beab67c3:

    # pa "Your friend deserves an apology, too."
    pa "我也该向你们那位朋友道歉。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10125
translate schinese ep11_md_label_1668cb23:

    # my "I'm sure they would appreciate that."
    my "我相信他们也会感激的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10127
translate schinese ep11_md_label_34c18156:

    # my "I'm sure he would appreciate that."
    my "我相信他一定会感激的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10128
translate schinese ep11_md_label_1cc25a08:

    # my "But..."
    my "但..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:10129
translate schinese ep11_md_label_8ea9ba88:

    # my "Are you sorry for what you did, or are you sorry that someone saw it?"
    my "你是因为做了那些事而抱歉，还是因为有人看到了才感到抱歉？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10137
translate schinese ep11_md_label_cdfa0a8b:

    # pa "Helen has had very dark thoughts lately. When she gets her episodes after taking her meds, she says horrible things."
    pa "Helen最近总往极端的地方想。她吃药后情绪发作，就会说些很可怕的话。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10138
translate schinese ep11_md_label_0fe6e6b9:

    # pa "Things I don't want you to hear. Thoughts I want to protect you from."
    pa "我不想让你听到这些事。我不想让你接触到这些想法。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10140
translate schinese ep11_md_label_d4babb50:

    # pa "But I don't know how long I can stand to hear about them myself."
    pa "可我也不知道，自己还撑得住听多久。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10142
translate schinese ep11_md_label_459f4ae3:

    # my "What is she saying?"
    my "她在说什么？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10144
translate schinese ep11_md_label_cb16be87:

    # pa "..."
    pa "..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:10146
translate schinese ep11_md_label_cbae12c9:

    # my "Dad? Tell us. We deserve to know."
    my "爸爸？告诉我们吧。我们有权利知道。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10148
translate schinese ep11_md_label_62038b69:

    # pa "How can I put this mildly to you...?"
    pa "我该怎么委婉地跟你说呢……？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10149
translate schinese ep11_md_label_8813466e:

    # pa "She says she doesn't want to go on living anymore. She says she wants to go to Canada or New Jersey to... Do you understand?"
    pa "她说她不想再继续活下去了。她说她想去加拿大或者新泽西……你明白吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10151
translate schinese ep11_md_label_d57c30e8:

    # de "Does she mean it?"
    de "她这是认真的吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10153
translate schinese ep11_md_label_22a22b5a:

    # pa "No. I don't think that she does. It's the pain that makes her say it. And those meds are affecting her mood."
    pa "不，我不这么认为。她只是在痛苦中才会这么说。那些药也影响了她的情绪。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10154
translate schinese ep11_md_label_9c98e796:

    # pa "She gets so mad. She screams at me. Nothing I do for her is enough."
    pa "她会气得发疯，对着我大喊大叫。我为她做的一切都不够。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10155
translate schinese ep11_md_label_d7a009e0:

    # pa "The Helen we know shines through that darkness when the episode is over."
    pa "等情绪缓过去，那个我们熟悉的Helen才又从阴霾中透出光来。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10157
translate schinese ep11_md_label_999eeeb4:

    # pa "But it's..."
    pa "可是……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10158
translate schinese ep11_md_label_9beafd96:

    # pa "It eats me up hearing her say those things."
    pa "听到她这么说，我简直要疯了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10160
translate schinese ep11_md_label_0e9aeb54:

    # de "Why haven't you told us earlier?"
    de "你为什么之前不告诉我们？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10162
translate schinese ep11_md_label_c4b75cd8:

    # pa "I didn't want to put that burden on you."
    pa "我不想把这负担强加给你们。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10164
translate schinese ep11_md_label_1d27bcce:

    # my "So, you chose to carry it all on your own? That's not healthy..."
    my "所以你选择一个人扛下所有？那可不健康……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10166
translate schinese ep11_md_label_b4c83bbe:

    # pa "I was raised not to talk about feelings."
    pa "我从小就不被允许表达情绪。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10167
translate schinese ep11_md_label_418d430a:

    # pa "My father used to beat me up if I cried. And he'd get drunk and get abusive with my brother and mother, too."
    pa "小时候，我一哭，父亲就会揍我。他喝醉了，还会虐待我的兄弟和母亲。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10169
translate schinese ep11_md_label_cdccb496:

    # pa "The day he died...drunk in that bathtub. I felt relief."
    pa "他死的那天……醉醺醺地泡在浴缸里。我感到一种解脱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10170
translate schinese ep11_md_label_4cebc773:

    # pa "And I promised myself that I wouldn't turn out like him."
    pa "我发誓自己不会变成他那样的人。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10172
translate schinese ep11_md_label_4d8afd50:

    # pa "And I can see it now... I broke that promise on Thanksgiving."
    pa "现在我才明白……感恩节那天，我违背了那个承诺。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10174
translate schinese ep11_md_label_02a2a8c5:

    # pa "*{i}Sobs{/i}*"
    pa "*{i}抽泣{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10175
translate schinese ep11_md_label_1428bf3e:

    # pa "I'm sorry. It wasn't supposed to turn out this way. Nothing was."
    pa "对不起。事情没按我想的那样发展。一切都不该这样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10177
translate schinese ep11_md_label_3f64a8c2:

    # pa "Life was supposed to be amazing for us."
    pa "我们的日子本来应该过得很美好。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10178
translate schinese ep11_md_label_55f5fb65:

    # pa "I'm sorry I couldn't fix everything."
    pa "对不起，我没能解决好一切。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10184
translate schinese ep11_md_label_c8c49824:

    # my "It wasn't just Thanksgiving, Dad."
    my "这不只是感恩节，爸爸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10185
translate schinese ep11_md_label_1c10634e:

    # my "But I...forgive you."
    my "但我...原谅你了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10190
translate schinese ep11_md_label_c028957e:

    # my "There's something you should know..."
    my "有件事得让你知道……"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10191
translate schinese ep11_md_label_9720e240:

    # my "I'm paying for college on my own from now on."
    my "从现在开始，我靠自己支付大学学费了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10193
translate schinese ep11_md_label_8fed8bec:

    # my "Thank you for lending me the money, but I've signed up for a student loan. I'll pay you back what I owe you."
    my "谢谢你借我钱，但我已经申请了学生贷款。我会还给你我欠的钱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10194
translate schinese ep11_md_label_5d4096a9:

    # my "And if you're truly sorry about what you did... You can show me that by letting me do this."
    my "如果你真的为做过的事感到抱歉……那就用让我这么做来证明。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10206
translate schinese ep11_md_label_0e048317:

    # de "That didn't go the way I expected..."
    de "那可没按我预期的进行..."

# episode11\update11.rpy:10208
translate schinese ep11_md_label_b2017de1:

    # my "I practiced everything I wanted to say to him...and all those feelings and words I had prepared changed right then and there."
    my "我本来已经练习好要对他说的话……可就在那时，那些准备好的感觉和话语全都变了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10210
translate schinese ep11_md_label_7ad2e0d0:

    # de "You did the right thing."
    de "你做得对。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10213
translate schinese ep11_md_label_5a088245:

    # de "I didn't expect him to apologize or say all those things."
    de "我没料到他会道歉或者说出那些话。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10215
translate schinese ep11_md_label_2a887169:

    # my "I know... I was stunned."
    my "我知道……我震惊了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10217
translate schinese ep11_md_label_030d6381:

    # de "You keep surprising me... You're amazing, you know that, right?"
    de "你总是让我意外...你真的很棒，你知道吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10220
translate schinese ep11_md_label_ad92fee2:

    # my "Do you think so?"
    my "你这么想吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10222
translate schinese ep11_md_label_5af06bfa:

    # de "I had a hard time doing what you did."
    de "换成我，很难做到你刚才那样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10224
translate schinese ep11_md_label_1c5e14ac:

    # my "But you forgave him, too."
    my "但你也是原谅了他。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10226
translate schinese ep11_md_label_7fa063ea:

    # de "Only because my hero did it."
    de "只因为我的英雄这么做了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10228
translate schinese ep11_md_label_c44a1158:

    # my "Who? Me?"
    my "谁？我？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10232
translate schinese ep11_md_label_c9e2f3d3:

    # de "Do you think he'll change, though?"
    de "你认为他会改变吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10234
translate schinese ep11_md_label_fbb89b8b:

    # my "Today, I saw something I never saw in him before."
    my "今天，我看到他身上从未有过的东西。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10235
translate schinese ep11_md_label_b7a083ee:

    # my "I want to give him that chance."
    my "我想给他这个机会。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10237
translate schinese ep11_md_label_f79c7738:

    # de "It was the first time I heard him talk about his dad."
    de "这是我第一次听他提起他爸爸。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10239
translate schinese ep11_md_label_4913080d:

    # my "I know. I only knew that story through Mom."
    my "我知道。这些事，我也只是听妈妈说过。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10240
translate schinese ep11_md_label_d20bc747:

    # my "He's had a rough childhood. He's carrying a lot."
    my "他小时候过得挺惨的，现在背负的东西不少。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10243
translate schinese ep11_md_label_bc8f7a6a:

    # de "You did it, Sis... You took the leap."
    de "玛雅，你做到了……你终于迈出了这一步。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10245
translate schinese ep11_md_label_5203efdc:

    # my "And I wish it felt better than it does."
    my "可我原以为，做到以后会比现在更开心些。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10246
translate schinese ep11_md_label_58d9f2a7:

    # my "I didn't tell him anything about Josy... But I felt it could wait."
    my "我还没跟他说Josy的事……但我觉得那个可以再等等。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10248
translate schinese ep11_md_label_b2002db2:

    # de "Do you regret not telling him?"
    de "你后悔没告诉他吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10250
translate schinese ep11_md_label_3b99f923:

    # my "No. It wasn't the right time for it. The result is the same for me; I no longer have to hide it from him."
    my "不，那时候还不是说这个的时候。结果对我而言也是一样，我现在再也不用瞒着他了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10251
translate schinese ep11_md_label_fdd4af81:

    # my "He lost that power over me today."
    my "他今天已经没那个本事控制我了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10254
translate schinese ep11_md_label_ac9d54f6:

    # de "That must feel great."
    de "那感觉一定很棒。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10256
translate schinese ep11_md_label_0c80de71:

    # my "I'm not sure yet."
    my "我现在还说不清。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10259
translate schinese ep11_md_label_0b4f99d3:

    # de "You're carrying loads yourself."
    de "你也在扛很多。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10261
translate schinese ep11_md_label_cf6bee02:

    # my "You're helping me carry it."
    my "你在帮我分担这份重量。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10262
translate schinese ep11_md_label_501da687:

    # my "Promise me we'll always be able to talk about feelings."
    my "答应我，我们永远都能谈论感受。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10264
translate schinese ep11_md_label_d5685e91:

    # de "I promise."
    de "我答应你。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10267
translate schinese ep11_md_label_27691783:

    # my "I hope he'll change. But I'm not willing to risk anything yet."
    my "我希望他能改变。但目前还不想冒任何风险。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10274
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_497a90b7:

    # ji "The place looks great. Did you do all of this by yourself?"
    ji "这地方看起来很棒。你一个人布置的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10276
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_eacf5c68:

    # isa "Thank you. Yes, I wanted to make room for everyone, and as a bonus, we get to view the Christmas tree while we're eating."
    isa "谢谢。是的，我想给大家留出空间，而且作为额外的好处，我们一边吃东西一边还能看到圣诞树。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10277
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_ddc00f3b:

    # isa "And by the way, you can put the gifts you brought underneath it."
    isa "顺便说一句，你带来的礼物可以放在下面。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10279
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_73aacfc4:

    # ji "Can I help out with the food?"
    ji "我能帮忙准备食物吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10281
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_c46782d4:

    # isa "I could use another set of hands."
    isa "正好，我也需要人搭把手。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10283
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_31201656:

    # sa "Haha! I love that Christmas sweater. Where did you get it?"
    sa "哈哈！我超喜欢这件圣诞毛衣。你哪儿买的？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10285
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_0de6a4d4:

    # my "I got it for Christmas last year from Mom and Dad. It's both stupid and cute at the same time."
    my "去年圣诞节爸妈送我的，又傻气又可爱。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10287
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_c0acc90f:

    # de "Wow, everyone's dressed as if it's the real deal tonight."
    de "哇，大家都打扮得像今晚真的过圣诞一样。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10289
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_19399865:

    # sa "Yes, we all look amazing. Nice bow tie."
    sa "是的，我们看起来都超棒。那条领结也挺酷的。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10291
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_031eea04:

    # de "Classy, huh?"
    de "很有格调吧？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10296
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_d75ae403:

    # ji "You went out of your way. This looks delicious."
    ji "你真是费心了，这些看着太好吃了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10300
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_03eca1f0:

    # isa "It's the one Christmas I plan to celebrate this year, so why not?"
    isa "这是我今年唯一打算庆祝的一次圣诞，当然得用心一些。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10302
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_48de354f:

    # ji "Are you holding up ok?"
    ji "你撑得住吗？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10304
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_752f026e:

    # isa "Thank you. I feel better than I did last year."
    isa "谢谢。我感觉比去年好多了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10305
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_821b35a0:

    # isa "How about you? How is the family?"
    isa "你那边怎么样？家里情况如何？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10307
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_3ebb6aeb:

    # ji "It won't be the best Christmas at our place, I can tell you that much. Dad's been drinking a bit too much lately."
    ji "这不会是我们家最棒的圣诞节，我可以告诉你这一点。我爸最近喝得有点多了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10309
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_fab93113:

    # isa "*{i}Sigh{/i}*"
    isa "*{i}叹气{/i}*"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10311
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_54eea9ad:

    # ji "But I have some good news, too. I met up with Jonathan. It's going to happen this spring."
    ji "不过我也有个好消息。我见到了Jonathan，这事春天就要成真了。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10313
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_27a8f0d4:

    # isa "It is?"
    isa "真的要办了？"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10315
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_2c14be24:

    # ji "We started making plans for it and he's on board."
    ji "我们已经开始计划这件事，他也在支持。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10316
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_9f52573b:

    # ji "There are many possibilities, but I don't know where to start. But luckily, he does."
    ji "有很多可能性，但我不知道从哪儿开始。不过幸运的是，他倒是知道该从哪儿着手。"

# episode11\update11.rpy:10317
translate schinese ep11_christmas_label_a78f8569:

    # ji "He'll help me set everything up. We talked about a website, donations, outreach, seminars..."
    ji "他会帮我把一切安排好。我们聊到了网站、募捐、宣传、研讨会……"

